WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:16.433
CASINO
HEOYOUNG LAND ONE YEAR ANNIVERSARY

2
00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:29.487
MANAGER BONG-CHEON KIM

3
00:00:38.246 --> 00:00:41.041
ACTIVATE VOICE RECOGNITION

4
00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:48.089
YOU ARE INVITED TO THE ONE YEAR ANNIVERSARY PARTY -

5
00:00:48.798 --> 00:00:51.134
HEOYOUNG LAND'S…

6
00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.345
DATE: TUESDAY, 8 April 2025, 10 PM.

7
00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:57.932
VENUE: HEOYOUNG LAND CASINO
VVIP GAME ROOM, 5TH FLOOR

8
00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:00.935
SEND

9
00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.397
FOR VVIP MEMBERS ONLY

10
00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:07.650
CASINO ONE YEAR CELEBRATION

11
00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:15.033
APRIL 8, 2025, 10 PM.

12
00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.035
Gold nuggets.

13
00:01:21.873 --> 00:01:22.874
I'm the first.

14
00:01:24.793 --> 00:01:26.086
When are the others coming?

15
00:01:26.669 --> 00:01:29.047
A VVIP guest should not wait.

16
00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:33.009
JEWELER AN
VVIP GUEST

17
00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:35.053
My makeup is amazing.

18
00:01:36.888 --> 00:01:38.515
I look twenty.

19
00:01:42.477 --> 00:01:43.311
Good day.

20
00:01:43.853 --> 00:01:44.771
Hello.

21
00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:49.275
What brings you here, Singer?
This is not for you.

22
00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:50.985
So.

23
00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:52.320
SINGER KIM
REGULAR PERFORMERS

24
00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:54.280
Isn't this for VVIP guests?

25
00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:00.954
IS HE A VVIP?

26
00:02:02.831 --> 00:02:03.748
Hello.

27
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.086
I've never been here.

28
00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:09.337
KITCHEN MASTER JANG

29
00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.297
You are the chef.
-So.

30
00:02:12.048 --> 00:02:13.591
Why do we gather?

31
00:02:15.844 --> 00:02:18.888
I wish you luck with today's card games.

32
00:02:18.972 --> 00:02:22.308
The players have come.

33
00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:23.893
Very nice to meet you.

34
00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.937
Good day.
-Hello.

35
00:02:26.521 --> 00:02:28.940
SEA CORP JANG
PLAYER OF THE HOUSE

36
00:02:29.023 --> 00:02:30.608
It's embarrassing.

37
00:02:30.692 --> 00:02:34.154
The players are there. Where is the dealer?

38
00:02:37.615 --> 00:02:39.200
Is that the mayor?

39
00:02:39.284 --> 00:02:43.371
What brings you here?
- Madam Mayor.

40
00:02:43.454 --> 00:02:44.581
Good day everyone.

41
00:02:45.248 --> 00:02:46.708
Have you been well?

42
00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:48.418
MAYOR JEON

43
00:02:48.501 --> 00:02:51.296
This is a surprise.
- You're fine.

44
00:02:51.379 --> 00:02:53.214
Goodness.

45
00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.341
AND YOU ARE…?

46
00:02:56.634 --> 00:03:00.305
I didn't know the mayor's result.
-This is a big event.

47
00:03:00.388 --> 00:03:04.392
Mrs. Mayor also came,
so this is a VVIP event.

48
00:03:06.394 --> 00:03:07.395
Yukra.

49
00:03:09.188 --> 00:03:11.482
Are you kidding me?
-Goodness.

50
00:03:12.066 --> 00:03:14.068
Who coughs in the company?
-Hard cough.

51
00:03:15.111 --> 00:03:19.198
Anyway…
Where is Bong-cheon?

52
00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:21.534
Shouldn't he greet guests?

53
00:03:21.618 --> 00:03:23.119
He should have come.

54
00:03:23.202 --> 00:03:24.579
IS SOMEONE MISSING?

55
00:03:24.662 --> 00:03:27.040
Please try to call.
-Where does he stay?

56
00:03:27.123 --> 00:03:29.250
I have her number.
-So.

57
00:03:29.334 --> 00:03:31.878
The main boss is usually not late.

58
00:03:31.961 --> 00:03:32.795
A little moment.

59
00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:37.383
Had he planned
something for us?

60
00:03:38.134 --> 00:03:40.094
TRYING TO CALL HIM

61
00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:43.056
He's here.

62
00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:47.393
Where?
- The phone is ringing over there.

63
00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:48.770
BEHIND THE CURTAINS?

64
00:03:48.853 --> 00:03:49.979
Is he on stage?

65
00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:53.524
He was planning some surprise.

66
00:03:53.608 --> 00:03:56.527
It wouldn't have been necessary.
-Why doesn't he come out?

67
00:03:57.111 --> 00:03:58.029
His number.

68
00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:08.957
Oh no.
- Yukra!

69
00:04:10.291 --> 00:04:11.501
Bong-cheon!

70
00:04:12.627 --> 00:04:13.503
What the hell?

71
00:04:14.212 --> 00:04:15.046
What the hell?

72
00:04:22.053 --> 00:04:23.096
What the hell is this?

73
00:04:23.179 --> 00:04:24.889
Blood!
-Oh no!

74
00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:27.809
That's the boss!

75
00:04:29.352 --> 00:04:33.231
MURDER OF THE CASINO BOSS I

76
00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:50.248
CRIME SCENE ZERO

77
00:04:52.834 --> 00:04:53.710
Oh no.
- Yukra!

78
00:04:55.003 --> 00:04:56.129
Bonk-cheon!

79
00:04:57.422 --> 00:04:58.756
What the hell?

80
00:04:58.840 --> 00:04:59.924
What the hell is this?

81
00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:01.509
What…
- Is that blood?

82
00:05:01.592 --> 00:05:03.803
What is it about?
-Is this part of the show?

83
00:05:03.886 --> 00:05:05.138
Boss?
- Bong-cheon?

84
00:05:05.221 --> 00:05:06.889
THE MANAGER WAS FOUND DEAD ON STAGE

85
00:05:06.973 --> 00:05:09.600
Are you okay?
-What is this?

86
00:05:09.684 --> 00:05:11.436
Blood!
-Oh no!

87
00:05:12.103 --> 00:05:12.937
What the hell?

88
00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:14.439
Goodness.

89
00:05:15.273 --> 00:05:17.358
Boss?

90
00:05:17.442 --> 00:05:18.443
My heart is pounding.

91
00:05:18.526 --> 00:05:21.029
What is it about?
-What the hell...

92
00:05:21.112 --> 00:05:23.323
Guests are not treated this way.
-What?

93
00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.243
My heart is pounding.

94
00:05:27.327 --> 00:05:29.370
What is it about?
- Jukra.

95
00:05:29.454 --> 00:05:32.790
What has happened?
- I have to go.

96
00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:34.500
IS HE TRYING TO ESCAPE THE PLACE?

97
00:05:34.584 --> 00:05:36.836
Where do you think you're going?

98
00:05:36.919 --> 00:05:38.046
PRINCIPAL RESEARCHER
DETECTIVE PARK

99
00:05:38.129 --> 00:05:40.006
Stand up.
- I want to go to the bathroom.

100
00:05:40.089 --> 00:05:41.382
No, you're coming with me.

101
00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:45.428
Move away. This is a crime scene.

102
00:05:45.511 --> 00:05:46.679
Keys off.

103
00:05:46.763 --> 00:05:47.805
First of all -

104
00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:51.517
don't try to leave
or go near a corpse.

105
00:05:51.601 --> 00:05:54.395
This is a murder scene.

106
00:05:54.479 --> 00:05:55.521
Murder?

107
00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:57.398
Was he murdered?

108
00:05:57.482 --> 00:05:59.192
Currently -

109
00:05:59.275 --> 00:06:03.362
you five are suspects.

110
00:06:03.446 --> 00:06:05.531
What are you talking about?
- Are you kidding me?

111
00:06:05.615 --> 00:06:09.160
We are not treated like this.
-I don't go to places like this.

112
00:06:09.827 --> 00:06:14.457
You will soon understand why you are suspected.

113
00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.793
Leave the stage to wait.

114
00:06:16.876 --> 00:06:18.336
Get off the stage now.

115
00:06:19.754 --> 00:06:21.964
I wouldn't bother killing.
- I'm busy.

116
00:06:22.048 --> 00:06:24.884
I can't believe this. That for a big win.

117
00:06:25.843 --> 00:06:27.136
Let's see.

118
00:06:28.846 --> 00:06:30.014
Was he shot?

119
00:06:30.932 --> 00:06:34.602
Those are gunshot wounds.
One on the head, one on the shoulder.

120
00:06:35.353 --> 00:06:38.314
The victim died instantly,
and there are no signs of a struggle.

121
00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:40.858
But your lips…

122
00:06:44.028 --> 00:06:48.699
This looks like murder,
which was designed to be seen.

123
00:06:48.783 --> 00:06:51.619
He is on stage in the VVIP arcade.

124
00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:53.204
Detective.
-Hello.

125
00:06:53.287 --> 00:06:55.957
I'm Minhee Kang, assistant sister.

126
00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.792
Are you an AE?
-Yes.

127
00:06:57.875 --> 00:06:59.669
You were recommended.

128
00:06:59.752 --> 00:07:01.671
It is an honor to work with you.
-So.

129
00:07:01.754 --> 00:07:03.548
What about the case file?

130
00:07:03.631 --> 00:07:05.049
I have a victim -

131
00:07:05.133 --> 00:07:07.135
and details of five suspects.
-Good.

132
00:07:07.218 --> 00:07:09.095
You are at work for the last day.

133
00:07:09.178 --> 00:07:11.055
Yes.
- You must be homesick.

134
00:07:12.223 --> 00:07:14.976
Shall we start with the victim?

135
00:07:15.643 --> 00:07:17.353
The victim is Bong-cheon Kim,

136
00:07:17.437 --> 00:07:18.980
A 60-year-old man.

137
00:07:19.063 --> 00:07:22.191
Asia's largest casino,
Heoyoung Landin, manager.

138
00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:24.277
He is the godfather of the casino business.

139
00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:26.779
The body was found on the stage of the VVIP game hall.

140
00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:30.950
It was going to be held in the hall
the casino's one-year anniversary.

141
00:07:31.033 --> 00:07:33.119
The cause of death is a gunshot wound to the head.

142
00:07:33.202 --> 00:07:37.540
The time of death is last night
between 10pm and midnight.

143
00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.625
That would mean

144
00:07:39.709 --> 00:07:44.005
that the body has been here
almost 24 hours.

145
00:07:44.088 --> 00:07:47.592
He was killed
at the casino's one-year anniversary,

146
00:07:47.675 --> 00:07:51.220
at the biggest celebration of his career,

147
00:07:51.304 --> 00:07:53.014
and was left to be seen.

148
00:07:55.391 --> 00:07:56.476
Let's get started.

149
00:07:59.187 --> 00:08:02.273
INVESTIGATION OF SUSPECTS

150
00:08:03.232 --> 00:08:05.359
First suspect: Mayor Jeon.

151
00:08:05.443 --> 00:08:08.821
A 42-year-old woman.
Mayor of Heoyoung Special City.

152
00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:11.949
Second suspect: Jeweler An.
A 56-year-old woman.

153
00:08:12.033 --> 00:08:16.537
Jewelry store owner
and the casino's VVIP customer.

154
00:08:16.621 --> 00:08:18.247
Third suspect: Singer Kim.

155
00:08:18.331 --> 00:08:19.957
A 43-year-old man.

156
00:08:20.041 --> 00:08:22.001
Casino regular.

157
00:08:22.084 --> 00:08:25.505
The fourth suspect: Chef Jang.
A 53-year-old man.

158
00:08:25.588 --> 00:08:28.257
He is the special chef for VVIP customers.

159
00:08:28.341 --> 00:08:32.011
The fifth suspect: Jang the cormorant.
A 48-year-old man.

160
00:08:32.094 --> 00:08:34.639
A professional gambler hired by a casino.

161
00:08:34.722 --> 00:08:37.642
You are now in a place,

162
00:08:37.725 --> 00:08:41.187
where leader Bong-cheon Kim was killed.

163
00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:44.649
First tell me,
why did you come here before me

164
00:08:44.732 --> 00:08:47.068
As you know,

165
00:08:47.151 --> 00:08:49.737
today was supposed to be a VVIP game.

166
00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:52.031
It had to be big.

167
00:08:52.114 --> 00:08:53.950
Really.
-What about the rest of you?

168
00:08:54.033 --> 00:08:56.077
Bong-cheon invited me.

169
00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:57.245
Were you close?

170
00:08:58.079 --> 00:08:59.455
Let's leave it at that.

171
00:08:59.539 --> 00:09:01.958
I didn't come to play or anything.

172
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:03.793
I got an invitation too.

173
00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:06.837
I got an invitation too.

174
00:09:06.921 --> 00:09:10.341
I'm just doing my thing in the kitchen,

175
00:09:10.424 --> 00:09:12.385
and I don't understand my invitation here.

176
00:09:12.468 --> 00:09:13.302
It's weird.

177
00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:16.806
They are not my usual opponents.

178
00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:19.684
Please introduce yourself -

179
00:09:19.767 --> 00:09:22.478
telling about your relationship with the deceased.

180
00:09:22.562 --> 00:09:24.313
Let's start with you, Madam Mayor.

181
00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:26.857
So I'm Mayor Jeon,

182
00:09:26.941 --> 00:09:28.609
The mayor of Heoyoung.

183
00:09:28.693 --> 00:09:29.777
So.
-You know me.

184
00:09:30.403 --> 00:09:33.948
Is your father's mayor Four Seasons Jeon?

185
00:09:35.157 --> 00:09:37.660
Really?
-They are known here.

186
00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:40.037
You and your father are a well-known duo.

187
00:09:40.121 --> 00:09:42.456
At Heoyoung Land Casino -

188
00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:46.335
plays an important role in the life of our city,

189
00:09:46.419 --> 00:09:51.048
because it attracts tourists
and boosts the local economy.

190
00:09:51.132 --> 00:09:53.384
Bong-cheon Kim, from whom I received the invitation,

191
00:09:53.467 --> 00:09:55.886
was important to me.

192
00:09:55.970 --> 00:09:59.140
Did your partnership focus
for the development of the city?

193
00:09:59.223 --> 00:10:00.600
Exactly.
- Or so.

194
00:10:00.683 --> 00:10:02.059
What about his "friends"?

195
00:10:02.143 --> 00:10:06.314
I am Jeweler An,
owner of a jewelry store.

196
00:10:06.397 --> 00:10:09.483
You can hardly say that we were close.

197
00:10:09.567 --> 00:10:11.485
When he asked for a favor, I agreed.

198
00:10:12.153 --> 00:10:13.404
That's how it was.

199
00:10:14.363 --> 00:10:17.575
You are not very young.
How long were you friends?

200
00:10:17.658 --> 00:10:19.201
I don't look like that.

201
00:10:19.285 --> 00:10:21.120
What?
-I was born in 1969.

202
00:10:21.203 --> 00:10:22.038
What?

203
00:10:22.121 --> 00:10:24.540
They say I look twenty.

204
00:10:24.624 --> 00:10:28.377
You didn't refuse
when he asked for a favor.

205
00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:30.046
That's all there is to it.

206
00:10:30.129 --> 00:10:31.464
Chef Jang.

207
00:10:31.547 --> 00:10:35.926
I am Heoyoung Land's VVIP Kitchen Master,

208
00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:38.888
who was recruited by the main boss himself.

209
00:10:38.971 --> 00:10:40.306
"The main boss?"
-So.

210
00:10:40.389 --> 00:10:42.391
You call him the main boss?

211
00:10:42.475 --> 00:10:44.935
He's the best in Korea, isn't he?

212
00:10:45.019 --> 00:10:48.481
Really?
-In the casino industry.

213
00:10:48.564 --> 00:10:50.941
Do you cook for VVIP customers?
-Yes.

214
00:10:51.025 --> 00:10:54.487
Only for them.
-Do you have Michelin stars?

215
00:10:55.655 --> 00:11:00.368
The ones with excellent taste
don't care about such.

216
00:11:00.451 --> 00:11:06.123
Have you been to Culinary Class Wars?
-A chef of my caliber -

217
00:11:06.999 --> 00:11:08.876
does not participate in such.
-Clear.

218
00:11:08.959 --> 00:11:11.587
Is that program below your level?

219
00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.757
Is that not up to you?

220
00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:17.843
So. I don't understand
the popularity of such programs.

221
00:11:17.927 --> 00:11:20.888
You don't even understand their producers.
-So.

222
00:11:20.971 --> 00:11:24.767
They are for untalented exams.
-Can you handle the consequences of that?

223
00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.061
All right. We understand.

224
00:11:27.144 --> 00:11:31.565
Are you also on the casino's payroll?
Singer Kim?

225
00:11:31.649 --> 00:11:35.194
Yes, I'm Singer Kim.
- We know that.

226
00:11:35.277 --> 00:11:37.947
Why are you coughing? Do you have a flu?

227
00:11:38.030 --> 00:11:41.158
I've been singing a lot lately,

228
00:11:41.242 --> 00:11:44.078
and my throat is too strained.

229
00:11:44.161 --> 00:11:45.746
Are you employed by the casino?

230
00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:48.207
Yes, I am a standard singer.

231
00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:52.253
I have performed now
For VVIP and VIP guests.

232
00:11:52.336 --> 00:11:56.257
VVIP customers worship him.
-Is he that good?

233
00:11:56.340 --> 00:11:59.260
When he begins his performance,

234
00:11:59.343 --> 00:12:01.345
everyone shouts: "Full on!"

235
00:12:01.429 --> 00:12:03.139
The songs have such a strong impact.

236
00:12:03.222 --> 00:12:05.433
Full on

237
00:12:05.516 --> 00:12:08.644
Full on

238
00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.105
Full on!

239
00:12:11.188 --> 00:12:13.482
Players like us -

240
00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:15.776
can't resist it.

241
00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:17.278
Are you a gambler too?

242
00:12:17.361 --> 00:12:19.780
I'm Jang the Seagull,

243
00:12:19.864 --> 00:12:25.619
professional gambler and in-house player,
who was hired by the casino.

244
00:12:26.287 --> 00:12:28.789
Where did you get that scar?

245
00:12:28.873 --> 00:12:30.166
This one?

246
00:12:30.249 --> 00:12:31.542
A dark past?

247
00:12:31.625 --> 00:12:36.297
Everyone gets scars during life,
or what?

248
00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:40.176
Did you get caught cheating?
- As if it would fit today.

249
00:12:40.259 --> 00:12:42.261
Did you deal based on the deck?

250
00:12:42.344 --> 00:12:43.762
Your hand is intact.

251
00:12:44.972 --> 00:12:47.057
Doesn't that say something?

252
00:12:47.141 --> 00:12:49.518
I'm not who you think I am.

253
00:12:49.602 --> 00:12:55.232
My duty was to support the boss
and his casino with my skills,

254
00:12:55.316 --> 00:12:56.817
and i did so.

255
00:12:56.901 --> 00:12:58.319
All right.

256
00:12:58.402 --> 00:13:03.157
I'll collect your alibi first
from the time of the murder,

257
00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.619
but the body was not immediately found.

258
00:13:06.702 --> 00:13:08.871
He was killed last night -

259
00:13:09.872 --> 00:13:11.916
between 10pm and midnight.
-What?

260
00:13:11.999 --> 00:13:15.377
The body lay here for almost a day,

261
00:13:15.461 --> 00:13:19.215
so i ask what you did last night.

262
00:13:19.298 --> 00:13:20.174
Madam Mayor.

263
00:13:20.257 --> 00:13:22.218
I had a very busy day,

264
00:13:22.301 --> 00:13:24.637
so I stayed late at the office.

265
00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.847
Are you working long hours now?

266
00:13:26.931 --> 00:13:28.349
Yes. My job is demanding.

267
00:13:28.432 --> 00:13:31.810
Singer Kim?
-I returned to my room at 21:20.

268
00:13:31.894 --> 00:13:35.356
I took the medicine and went to sleep.
-Clear.

269
00:13:35.439 --> 00:13:37.525
I guess you had some time off, Chef?

270
00:13:37.608 --> 00:13:40.653
Yes. I went to my room
after my shift is over.

271
00:13:40.736 --> 00:13:42.530
How about you, Jeweler?

272
00:13:42.613 --> 00:13:47.284
I played on the third floor.
-At the VIP table.

273
00:13:47.368 --> 00:13:48.452
How about you, Sea Grouse?

274
00:13:48.536 --> 00:13:51.747
I played until around 10.10pm -

275
00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:53.332
and i went to my room.

276
00:13:53.415 --> 00:13:55.668
Your timelines collide. Did you see each other?

277
00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:59.129
I'm not sure. Did you see me?

278
00:14:01.215 --> 00:14:02.174
Of course.

279
00:14:02.258 --> 00:14:05.594
Did you see me?
-You played until a little past ten.

280
00:14:05.678 --> 00:14:07.054
I don't remember seeing you.

281
00:14:07.972 --> 00:14:11.642
The game requires concentration.
-Understandable.

282
00:14:11.725 --> 00:14:16.313
Jeweler Ani's alibi has been confirmed
at least until 22:10,

283
00:14:16.397 --> 00:14:18.983
but Merikrott was not seen.

284
00:14:19.066 --> 00:14:20.859
That was all for now.

285
00:14:20.943 --> 00:14:23.779
Someone is clearly lying,

286
00:14:23.862 --> 00:14:27.491
and traces of the killer are found at the crime scene.

287
00:14:27.575 --> 00:14:31.412
Look for evidence,
prove your theory right -

288
00:14:31.495 --> 00:14:33.414
and identify the killer,

289
00:14:33.497 --> 00:14:35.791
so that we can part amicably.

290
00:14:36.292 --> 00:14:38.544
Shall we go?

291
00:14:38.627 --> 00:14:40.004
Let's disperse.

292
00:14:40.087 --> 00:14:42.673
I'm still shocked.
-I got hurt.

293
00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.887
CRIME SCENE INVESTIGATION

294
00:14:51.348 --> 00:14:54.435
APRIL 8, 2025
CASINO ONE YEAR CELEBRATION

295
00:14:55.060 --> 00:14:58.147
THE VICTIM WAS FOUND MURDERED ON THE STAGE

296
00:14:59.982 --> 00:15:03.027
CASINO MANAGER BONG-CHEON KIM

297
00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:05.654
HEOYOUNG LAND CASINO

298
00:15:05.738 --> 00:15:06.697
STAGE, DRESSING ROOM

299
00:15:06.780 --> 00:15:09.450
VVIP GAME ROOM, MANAGER'S WORK ROOM

300
00:15:09.533 --> 00:15:11.410
THE SINGER'S ROOM,
KITCHEN'S ROOM

301
00:15:11.493 --> 00:15:12.786
MERIKROTTI JANG'S ROOM

302
00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:13.913
STAFF STATUS

303
00:15:13.996 --> 00:15:14.914
JEWELRY STORE

304
00:15:14.997 --> 00:15:15.831
MAYOR'S ROOM

305
00:15:15.915 --> 00:15:17.708
CITY ARCHIVES

306
00:15:18.292 --> 00:15:20.794
CRIME SCENE INVESTIGATION
15 MIN IN PAIRS.

307
00:15:21.378 --> 00:15:23.672
How long have you been a chef?

308
00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:25.591
I was born with my gifts.

309
00:15:26.342 --> 00:15:27.551
TEAM 2: MERICROTT & SINGER

310
00:15:27.635 --> 00:15:28.552
What is it about?

311
00:15:28.636 --> 00:15:30.679
I don't have time to dwell on this.

312
00:15:30.763 --> 00:15:32.598
Will the body be examined?
-Sure.

313
00:15:32.681 --> 00:15:34.099
INVESTIGATING THE BODY FIRST

314
00:15:34.183 --> 00:15:37.227
How did the boss get here?

315
00:15:37.311 --> 00:15:39.480
How can this happen?

316
00:15:40.105 --> 00:15:42.858
Why is he on stage?
-Did he enjoy being on display?

317
00:15:44.109 --> 00:15:45.653
And spotlights too.

318
00:15:47.279 --> 00:15:48.781
Did he enjoy performing?

319
00:15:50.616 --> 00:15:53.160
Does this remind you of Mint?

320
00:15:53.243 --> 00:15:54.495
MONEY FORGE?

321
00:15:54.578 --> 00:15:55.663
Or House of Cards?

322
00:15:55.746 --> 00:15:57.373
TOWER OF CARDS
(I.E. HOUSE OF CARDS)

323
00:15:58.707 --> 00:16:01.293
Was he shot?
-Really?

324
00:16:01.377 --> 00:16:04.046
Isn't it a wound on the forehead
look like a gunshot wound?

325
00:16:04.129 --> 00:16:05.673
He was shot twice.

326
00:16:05.756 --> 00:16:07.633
On the shoulder and forehead.

327
00:16:07.716 --> 00:16:10.636
The shooter was standing in front of him.

328
00:16:10.719 --> 00:16:13.430
He had to be shot from the front…
Good time.

329
00:16:13.514 --> 00:16:15.599
A larger exit wound confirms that.

330
00:16:15.683 --> 00:16:18.727
Shouldn't there be shells?

331
00:16:18.811 --> 00:16:20.688
Yes, because they pierced him.

332
00:16:20.771 --> 00:16:23.023
What does that mean?

333
00:16:23.107 --> 00:16:25.275
Did she wear lipstick?

334
00:16:25.359 --> 00:16:28.112
No, that's not his style.

335
00:16:28.195 --> 00:16:30.906
Maybe a kiss of death with closed lips?

336
00:16:31.907 --> 00:16:34.785
Why would someone kiss after being shot twice?

337
00:16:34.868 --> 00:16:35.995
Goodbye.

338
00:16:36.078 --> 00:16:36.954
KISS GOODBYE?

339
00:16:37.037 --> 00:16:38.580
What is this?

340
00:16:38.664 --> 00:16:40.833
Why is the stomach swollen? Liquids?

341
00:16:40.916 --> 00:16:43.711
Oh no.
-Let's check the pockets.

342
00:16:44.294 --> 00:16:45.546
I found the phone.

343
00:16:45.629 --> 00:16:47.589
BONG-CHEON KIM'S PHONE

344
00:16:47.673 --> 00:16:49.425
Who is "Rude Little Shit"?

345
00:16:49.508 --> 00:16:51.510
"Rude little shit."
-Really?

346
00:16:51.593 --> 00:16:53.721
He was talking to one.

347
00:16:53.804 --> 00:16:55.347
Let's see the messages.

348
00:16:55.431 --> 00:16:57.182
"Rude little shit?"
-What?

349
00:16:57.266 --> 00:16:58.600
Look at this.

350
00:16:58.684 --> 00:17:00.102
RUDE LITTLE SHIT

351
00:17:00.185 --> 00:17:02.521
"I already looked into it. What do you know? Obey."

352
00:17:03.814 --> 00:17:05.899
(WHAT?)

353
00:17:05.983 --> 00:17:08.110
"Is everything ready for the opening?"

354
00:17:08.193 --> 00:17:10.487
"Vault..." "Yes, but I might not have time."

355
00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:14.199
"The Truth Behind the Jeons."

356
00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.202
This applies to you.

357
00:17:20.039 --> 00:17:24.376
Jeon is a common surname.
-"The truth behind the Jeons."

358
00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.003
Is there anything else there?

359
00:17:26.086 --> 00:17:27.963
Messages to Secretary Kim.
-What?

360
00:17:28.047 --> 00:17:29.673
"Go home already."

361
00:17:31.633 --> 00:17:33.635
Wait a minute. "Duffer."

362
00:17:35.512 --> 00:17:37.222
This…
-Who is Tohelo An?

363
00:17:37.306 --> 00:17:38.348
Moment.
- I don't know.

364
00:17:38.432 --> 00:17:41.351
Isn't your last name An?
- I don't know.

365
00:17:41.935 --> 00:17:42.853
"Tohello An."

366
00:17:44.396 --> 00:17:45.856
MESSAGES TO TOHELO

367
00:17:46.774 --> 00:17:52.946
“Bong-cheon, you know the CEO of Heaven Consortium.
We'll be right back. I want my regular table."

368
00:17:53.030 --> 00:17:54.615
He was a regular.

369
00:17:54.698 --> 00:17:56.950
He really was a tohelo.

370
00:17:57.034 --> 00:17:58.077
SEA CORP JANG

371
00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.661
"Tohelo is coming here."

372
00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:01.705
"Okay. You can trust me."

373
00:18:01.789 --> 00:18:03.040
A message to the Chef.

374
00:18:03.123 --> 00:18:05.918
"Tomorrow is the one-year anniversary.
Special food."

375
00:18:06.001 --> 00:18:07.669
"I make special food."

376
00:18:07.753 --> 00:18:09.213
Something special?

377
00:18:09.296 --> 00:18:11.673
SPECIAL FOOD?

378
00:18:11.757 --> 00:18:14.218
DRESSING ROOM

379
00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:18.097
Detective.
-So?

380
00:18:18.180 --> 00:18:21.809
There is a gas warning.

381
00:18:22.893 --> 00:18:26.021
And here are the instructions for the cleaners.

382
00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:27.981
"Rules of Cleanliness."

383
00:18:28.065 --> 00:18:31.276
“On the hill behind the casino
are often carcasses.

384
00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.070
In summer they are filled with gas -

385
00:18:33.153 --> 00:18:35.864
and can explode, so remove them."

386
00:18:36.782 --> 00:18:39.076
Strange instructions for the cleaning team.

387
00:18:39.952 --> 00:18:40.994
VVIP GAME ROOM

388
00:18:41.078 --> 00:18:43.247
I'm a fool. Gotta check the phones.

389
00:18:43.330 --> 00:18:46.834
This day was reserved for VVIP customers.

390
00:18:46.917 --> 00:18:48.293
Truth be told -

391
00:18:48.377 --> 00:18:51.547
just Mayor Jeon and me
we were worthy of the invitation.

392
00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:55.134
i want to know
Did Bong-cheon invite the others too.

393
00:18:55.217 --> 00:18:58.053
Who do you belong to?

394
00:18:58.595 --> 00:19:01.098
Singer Kim, huh? You are suspicious.

395
00:19:01.974 --> 00:19:03.308
"J Mail."

396
00:19:04.268 --> 00:19:06.228
Same as the invitation I received.

397
00:19:06.728 --> 00:19:08.772
ATTACHED TOKEN COUPON

398
00:19:08.856 --> 00:19:10.774
WORTH 100,000,000 WON

399
00:19:10.858 --> 00:19:12.359
Porcupine Jang -

400
00:19:12.442 --> 00:19:16.446
and Jeweler An was also invited -

401
00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.865
like me.

402
00:19:18.448 --> 00:19:19.700
"V message bot?"

403
00:19:19.783 --> 00:19:20.617
(SINGER'S PHONE)

404
00:19:21.743 --> 00:19:22.744
What is this?

405
00:19:22.828 --> 00:19:24.621
CALLING LIST CREATED BY ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE

406
00:19:24.705 --> 00:19:27.457
"I will not renew my contract with the casino."

407
00:19:27.541 --> 00:19:30.210
"I'm going to Las Vegas to perform."

408
00:19:30.294 --> 00:19:33.380
COME ON. TIME IS RUNNING OUT

409
00:19:33.463 --> 00:19:34.798
Why didn't he wait a week?

410
00:19:34.882 --> 00:19:36.133
...8. UNTIL THE DAY

411
00:19:36.717 --> 00:19:39.428
STAFF FACILITIES

412
00:19:40.804 --> 00:19:42.764
Those staying at the casino -

413
00:19:42.848 --> 00:19:45.350
Merikrotti, Chef and Singer.

414
00:19:45.934 --> 00:19:46.935
THE SINGER'S ROOM

415
00:19:47.019 --> 00:19:48.645
Let's see, Singer Kim.

416
00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:52.024
To Las Vegas?

417
00:19:53.233 --> 00:19:54.943
You wanted to perform in the USA.

418
00:19:58.197 --> 00:19:59.156
What is this?

419
00:20:00.324 --> 00:20:02.534
Gifts from fans?
Mickey has his name on it.

420
00:20:06.205 --> 00:20:08.498
Are these fan letters?

421
00:20:08.582 --> 00:20:11.585
"Singer,
you drive me crazy with your screams."

422
00:20:14.087 --> 00:20:17.132
“The voice of an angel.
You belong to a bigger stage.

423
00:20:17.966 --> 00:20:19.426
Greetings, Wife Hwang."

424
00:20:19.509 --> 00:20:21.053
He has admirers.

425
00:20:23.138 --> 00:20:24.514
What's in the box?

426
00:20:24.598 --> 00:20:26.183
The restaurant's account book.

427
00:20:29.102 --> 00:20:30.062
"Mackerel."

428
00:20:30.145 --> 00:20:31.438
"Income and Expenditure."

429
00:20:31.521 --> 00:20:33.690
"Sea Grouse Jang's Fishery."

430
00:20:33.774 --> 00:20:35.651
He was working at the fish market.

431
00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:38.946
FRESH FISH

432
00:20:39.029 --> 00:20:40.530
That's the Singer from before.

433
00:20:40.614 --> 00:20:44.243
“You have the voice of a nightingale.
Who did you inherit it from?"

434
00:20:45.869 --> 00:20:47.162
This is a family photo.

435
00:20:47.246 --> 00:20:48.872
SINGER'S FAMILY PHOTO

436
00:20:48.956 --> 00:20:51.166
“I will succeed
and I will give you a comfortable life."

437
00:20:52.709 --> 00:20:55.587
"Pennies entertainment. Jin entertainment."

438
00:20:56.546 --> 00:20:59.716
“You can be the next Jo Sung-mo.
All you need is 50 million won.”

439
00:21:02.427 --> 00:21:05.806
Account book. This can be important.
Let's see.

440
00:21:05.889 --> 00:21:08.141
THE SINGER'S ACCOUNT

441
00:21:08.725 --> 00:21:10.102
"Boom Boom Karaoke,

442
00:21:10.185 --> 00:21:11.812
everything possible..."

443
00:21:11.895 --> 00:21:15.857
He toiled and sent the money
For the Pennitö entertainment company.

444
00:21:17.693 --> 00:21:18.902
What?

445
00:21:20.153 --> 00:21:23.657
“Dong Fertilizer Company.
FR. Tilizer's chemicals."

446
00:21:23.740 --> 00:21:25.867
SUSPICIOUS BUSINESS CARDS?

447
00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:27.327
What companies are these?

448
00:21:32.124 --> 00:21:34.042
"Gazi's Adult Nightclub."

449
00:21:34.126 --> 00:21:35.877
Did he perform there?

450
00:21:35.961 --> 00:21:37.087
THE KING OF CATTLE SCREAMS

451
00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:39.131
Am I too old for this?

452
00:21:39.214 --> 00:21:41.383
ENVELOPE IN A TABLE BOX

453
00:21:41.967 --> 00:21:43.635
"Employment contract of standard singer."

454
00:21:45.512 --> 00:21:47.889
"September 1, 2024
and March 31, 2025.

455
00:21:47.973 --> 00:21:51.018
Must perform all year round."

456
00:21:51.518 --> 00:21:52.894
I examined the trash can.

457
00:21:52.978 --> 00:21:53.979
There's something here.

458
00:21:55.522 --> 00:21:57.566
"If you get caught, I'll shoot you."

459
00:21:58.608 --> 00:21:59.818
Is that a gun?

460
00:21:59.901 --> 00:22:01.486
Did someone threaten him?

461
00:22:03.530 --> 00:22:05.991
I'm looking at the computer now.

462
00:22:06.575 --> 00:22:08.201
SINGER KIM'S COMPUTER

463
00:22:09.494 --> 00:22:10.912
"Messages."

464
00:22:10.996 --> 00:22:16.543
From La Vega. "Singer, I was disappointed,
that you won't come to the audition."

465
00:22:18.045 --> 00:22:19.338
(PICTURE ATTACHMENT?)

466
00:22:21.423 --> 00:22:23.467
Talent scout from Las Vegas.

467
00:22:23.550 --> 00:22:24.968
SCRIPT FROM EMAIL

468
00:22:26.136 --> 00:22:27.679
"He doesn't audition."

469
00:22:28.847 --> 00:22:30.891
I glance at Chef Jang's room.

470
00:22:30.974 --> 00:22:32.809
CHEF JANG'S ROOM

471
00:22:35.520 --> 00:22:36.646
"Feedback card."

472
00:22:39.691 --> 00:22:42.319
"Splendid casino, premium meats."

473
00:22:42.402 --> 00:22:44.112
"Sexy food."

474
00:22:44.196 --> 00:22:47.115
He must be a good cook.

475
00:22:48.283 --> 00:22:50.285
Isn't that a yoga mat?

476
00:22:50.368 --> 00:22:53.038
This is used for meditation.

477
00:22:54.623 --> 00:22:56.750
MEDITATION EQUIPMENT?

478
00:22:56.833 --> 00:22:58.085
"Fleek Meditation Center."

479
00:22:58.168 --> 00:22:59.169
MEDITATION CENTER

480
00:22:59.252 --> 00:23:00.629
He likes to meditate.

481
00:23:01.254 --> 00:23:03.924
"Director Cult Director Na.
Your message to the world."

482
00:23:04.007 --> 00:23:06.760
"There is no more hope.
A new world is needed."

483
00:23:07.844 --> 00:23:09.554
"The cause of my misery is Bong-cheon Kim?"

484
00:23:10.097 --> 00:23:11.348
What is this?

485
00:23:12.432 --> 00:23:15.685
We await that day.
Written by Cult Director Na.

486
00:23:15.769 --> 00:23:19.773
He is clearly not sane.

487
00:23:19.856 --> 00:23:24.319
“Listen, members of the Messianic Church.
Greed is the source of misery.

488
00:23:24.402 --> 00:23:27.656
How to get rid of it?
A sacrifice must be offered."

489
00:23:28.657 --> 00:23:29.950
A victim, huh?

490
00:23:31.118 --> 00:23:34.955
How much did he really sacrifice for the cult?

491
00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:40.502
The answer can be found in the account book.

492
00:23:43.296 --> 00:23:46.466
He received the Four Seasons from Jeon
three billion won.

493
00:23:46.550 --> 00:23:49.302
Isn't that Mayor Jeon's father?

494
00:23:49.386 --> 00:23:53.181
He raised three billion
and established a clinic.

495
00:23:53.765 --> 00:23:55.225
Is this guy a doctor?

496
00:23:56.226 --> 00:23:57.310
Is there something? No.

497
00:23:58.728 --> 00:24:00.480
A bag can be a gold mine.

498
00:24:00.564 --> 00:24:01.773
KITCHEN BAG

499
00:24:01.857 --> 00:24:02.774
Let's see.

500
00:24:04.484 --> 00:24:05.610
What is this?

501
00:24:06.194 --> 00:24:08.113
CLINIC BROCHURE

502
00:24:08.697 --> 00:24:10.073
This is the Chef.

503
00:24:10.157 --> 00:24:11.366
And my father.

504
00:24:11.449 --> 00:24:13.577
What? He's actually a doctor.

505
00:24:13.660 --> 00:24:15.120
Why is he a chef?

506
00:24:15.787 --> 00:24:16.830
Wait a minute.

507
00:24:17.414 --> 00:24:18.832
"The plaintiff, Celebrity Hong."

508
00:24:19.583 --> 00:24:24.004
He had to pay five billion.
That's why he grinds.

509
00:24:28.049 --> 00:24:31.386
Patient Oh's health information.

510
00:24:32.137 --> 00:24:33.972
These are local people.

511
00:24:34.055 --> 00:24:36.600
This person had a cold.

512
00:24:37.392 --> 00:24:39.060
And the flu again.

513
00:24:39.144 --> 00:24:40.812
And the flu again.

514
00:24:40.896 --> 00:24:42.689
Everyone had the flu.

515
00:24:43.607 --> 00:24:45.942
You guys were up to something suspicious.

516
00:24:46.026 --> 00:24:47.569
NEUROSURGERY - DOCTOR JANG

517
00:24:47.652 --> 00:24:48.737
MERIKROTTI JANG'S ROOM

518
00:24:48.820 --> 00:24:50.947
Staff status. Merikrot's room.

519
00:24:51.031 --> 00:24:54.993
Jang the cormorant
was the closest leader with Kim,

520
00:24:55.076 --> 00:24:56.786
so I wanted to research him.

521
00:24:58.205 --> 00:24:59.080
What is this?

522
00:24:59.873 --> 00:25:01.791
The official residence of the police?

523
00:25:04.419 --> 00:25:06.546
Why are there women's clothes here?

524
00:25:06.630 --> 00:25:07.631
A DRESS?

525
00:25:07.714 --> 00:25:09.132
Does she cosplay?

526
00:25:09.966 --> 00:25:12.052
What about in the box? And not.

