He ran the clinic -

792
00:38:35.396 --> 00:38:38.149
In Gangdam for 20 years.

793
00:38:38.232 --> 00:38:41.861
No wonder.
-That's why white color suits him.

794
00:38:41.944 --> 00:38:44.655
This is hard to understand.

795
00:38:44.739 --> 00:38:47.325
He was a popular doctor,

796
00:38:47.408 --> 00:38:50.870
which led
successful clinic for more than 20 years.

797
00:38:50.953 --> 00:38:53.414
Why a three billion loan,

798
00:38:53.497 --> 00:38:56.083
who forced him into the soup -

799
00:38:56.167 --> 00:39:00.338
and to obey the lender
absolutely everything?

800
00:39:00.421 --> 00:39:01.964
Life is short.

801
00:39:02.048 --> 00:39:05.843
I wanted mine to be dynamic.
-Sure.

802
00:39:05.926 --> 00:39:09.555
Thus thought
transitioning into a chef is not a shock.

803
00:39:09.638 --> 00:39:11.015
Really?

804
00:39:11.098 --> 00:39:15.061
I thought you were a genuine VVIP customer,

805
00:39:15.144 --> 00:39:16.979
but I didn't realize your value.

806
00:39:18.189 --> 00:39:20.107
Next is Korukauppias An.

807
00:39:20.191 --> 00:39:22.651
He has a lot to talk about.

808
00:39:22.735 --> 00:39:24.695
You have a VVIP card,

809
00:39:24.779 --> 00:39:29.533
which can be accessed in this casino
just about anywhere.

810
00:39:29.617 --> 00:39:30.451
Really?

811
00:39:30.534 --> 00:39:32.536
The boss…
-You don't know how much I paid.

812
00:39:32.620 --> 00:39:36.874
Maybe you noticed that he has
has deposits over 70 billion won.

813
00:39:36.957 --> 00:39:38.084
73.4 billion.

814
00:39:38.167 --> 00:39:40.920
You weren't born rich.

815
00:39:41.545 --> 00:39:44.298
You have done some questionable work.

816
00:39:44.382 --> 00:39:48.344
You have been selling cheap copies -

817
00:39:48.427 --> 00:39:51.764
or gold-plated jewelry in gold.

818
00:39:51.847 --> 00:39:53.015
You surely know -

819
00:39:53.099 --> 00:39:56.602
extremely expensive
From the "Slime of the Sun" gem.

820
00:39:56.685 --> 00:39:59.647
Worth billions?
- Seven billion won.

821
00:39:59.730 --> 00:40:02.525
He smuggled it to China.

822
00:40:02.608 --> 00:40:04.735
However, this is important.

823
00:40:05.319 --> 00:40:08.239
Your older sister was Rehti An, right?

824
00:40:08.322 --> 00:40:11.075
He got hit by a car,
and the driver fled the scene.

825
00:40:11.158 --> 00:40:14.203
He died because of your family
could not afford surgery.

826
00:40:14.954 --> 00:40:18.457
After your sister died -

827
00:40:18.541 --> 00:40:22.670
you planned and saved
for more than 20 years -

828
00:40:22.753 --> 00:40:25.256
for revenge.

829
00:40:25.339 --> 00:40:27.466
This needs to be investigated.

830
00:40:27.550 --> 00:40:31.345
I will surely miss seeing you
Mayor Jeon here.

831
00:40:31.429 --> 00:40:32.972
Never mind.
- Me?

832
00:40:33.055 --> 00:40:36.976
You say in your diary
Four Through Jeon as your sister's murderer.

833
00:40:37.059 --> 00:40:39.270
My father wouldn't have done that.

834
00:40:39.353 --> 00:40:41.480
You are mistaken.
-The daughter resembles her father.

835
00:40:41.564 --> 00:40:43.732
Is this new, Mayor Jeon?

836
00:40:43.816 --> 00:40:46.402
I didn't know about this.
-Is your father alive?

837
00:40:46.986 --> 00:40:49.155
He is dead.
- Or so.

838
00:40:49.238 --> 00:40:51.407
I'll turn this over to my boss.

839
00:40:51.490 --> 00:40:54.577
Some notes
seemed to refer to him.

840
00:40:54.660 --> 00:40:57.371
"Bastard" and game caves.

841
00:40:57.455 --> 00:41:01.500
Nothing connects directly
his sister's death -

842
00:41:01.584 --> 00:41:05.671
Four Ways to Jeon, Mayor to Jeon
or to today's sacrifice.

843
00:41:05.754 --> 00:41:09.216
Not yet.
- We'll keep an eye on it.

844
00:41:09.300 --> 00:41:12.011
Good job, Jang the Seagull.
-Thanks.

845
00:41:12.094 --> 00:41:13.721
Jeweler An.

846
00:41:13.804 --> 00:41:14.638
All right.

847
00:41:14.722 --> 00:41:18.476
I'll tell you right now that I have
100 billion in funds.

848
00:41:18.559 --> 00:41:21.812
You saved more than 70 billion in the casino.

849
00:41:21.896 --> 00:41:24.315
70 percent of them were deposited here.

850
00:41:24.398 --> 00:41:26.734
It's worth mentioning.
-Sure.

851
00:41:27.610 --> 00:41:30.279
I started thinking

852
00:41:30.362 --> 00:41:33.032
that the murder was a show.
-Yes.

853
00:41:33.115 --> 00:41:36.994
The body was laid out for viewing.

854
00:41:37.077 --> 00:41:39.997
I was puzzled,
that Singer Kim, Cormorant Jang -

855
00:41:40.080 --> 00:41:44.084
and Chef Jang had been invited
For the event of VVIP customers.

856
00:41:44.168 --> 00:41:46.003
Likewise.
-What if we -

857
00:41:46.086 --> 00:41:49.131
was called after the murder
to prove -

858
00:41:49.215 --> 00:41:51.634
this kind of show?

859
00:41:51.717 --> 00:41:53.761
I have a question.
-Please.

860
00:41:53.844 --> 00:41:56.597
Who did you get the invitation from?

861
00:41:56.680 --> 00:41:59.141
From Bong-cheon?
-I got an email from the boss.

862
00:41:59.225 --> 00:42:00.684
So.
-When?

863
00:42:00.768 --> 00:42:03.687
That's the time this morning.
- Is it?

864
00:42:03.771 --> 00:42:04.980
Likewise.
-What about you?

865
00:42:05.064 --> 00:42:09.610
So the killer invited everyone
as the manager of the casino,

866
00:42:09.693 --> 00:42:13.155
that ye may see the body.
-Exactly.

867
00:42:13.239 --> 00:42:15.950
I'll start with singer Kim.

868
00:42:16.033 --> 00:42:16.867
Do I?

869
00:42:16.951 --> 00:42:18.869
I liked your childhood picture,

870
00:42:18.953 --> 00:42:22.581
where you sing a soda bottle as a microphone -

871
00:42:22.665 --> 00:42:25.292
in front of the fish restaurant.
-Did you have a restaurant?

872
00:42:25.376 --> 00:42:27.711
I didn't grow up wealthy.

873
00:42:27.795 --> 00:42:30.464
But our family liked one.

874
00:42:30.548 --> 00:42:31.382
Of course.

875
00:42:31.465 --> 00:42:34.927
There was also
entertainment agency business card.

876
00:42:35.010 --> 00:42:38.973
According to it, 50 million won
would make you successful.

877
00:42:39.056 --> 00:42:42.059
You earned 50 million
in a suspicious manner.

878
00:42:42.142 --> 00:42:44.979
You were at work
in fertilizer and chemical plants.

879
00:42:45.062 --> 00:42:47.648
You earned 5 to 10 million each.

880
00:42:47.731 --> 00:42:51.151
They didn't look like a monthly salary.
-Large sums.

881
00:42:51.735 --> 00:42:55.489
I didn't work in fertilizer factories.
I handled problematic waste.

882
00:42:55.573 --> 00:42:58.033
Like cadmium?

883
00:42:58.117 --> 00:43:00.536
Auto in removing them.

884
00:43:00.619 --> 00:43:02.454
I was kind of their sidekick.

885
00:43:02.538 --> 00:43:05.958
You were there
in illegal waste removal.

886
00:43:06.041 --> 00:43:07.751
These terms are scary.

887
00:43:07.835 --> 00:43:11.630
Isn't that a punishable act?
-Necessarily.

888
00:43:12.298 --> 00:43:14.925
As you can see,

889
00:43:15.009 --> 00:43:17.636
The singer signed the contract.
-Really?

890
00:43:17.720 --> 00:43:21.515
It was with the casino,
but the conditions were bad for him.

891
00:43:21.599 --> 00:43:24.602
He had to perform around the clock,

892
00:43:24.685 --> 00:43:27.521
and the casino is always open.

893
00:43:27.605 --> 00:43:30.608
I speak from experience,
because I was a singer myself.

894
00:43:30.691 --> 00:43:31.984
It violates labor laws.

895
00:43:32.067 --> 00:43:35.613
If you always have to sing,
must be furious.

896
00:43:35.696 --> 00:43:38.824
Did he know anything about you?
-I want to ask the same thing.

897
00:43:38.907 --> 00:43:41.035
Maybe this was the reason.

898
00:43:41.118 --> 00:43:42.036
What is it?

899
00:43:42.119 --> 00:43:43.162
Wife Hwang.

900
00:43:43.912 --> 00:43:46.957
He wrote:
"You belong to a bigger stage."

901
00:43:47.041 --> 00:43:48.500
He meant the casino.

902
00:43:48.584 --> 00:43:51.170
You didn't know him, did you?

903
00:43:51.253 --> 00:43:54.757
He is our own leader
Bong-cheon Kim's wife.

904
00:43:54.840 --> 00:43:57.009
Was she your sugar mama?
- Outrageous.

905
00:43:57.092 --> 00:43:59.219
Don't make it suspicious.

906
00:43:59.303 --> 00:44:02.514
Wake up outside, please.

907
00:44:03.515 --> 00:44:04.350
Sorry.

908
00:44:04.433 --> 00:44:07.061
What do you think you're doing?
-And not.

909
00:44:07.144 --> 00:44:09.021
Smoking inside is illegal.

910
00:44:09.104 --> 00:44:10.814
He didn't cry.
-I can see it.

911
00:44:10.898 --> 00:44:12.983
I didn't smoke.
-Does your throat hurt?

912
00:44:13.567 --> 00:44:18.280
Bad air in the casino
affected his lungs.

913
00:44:18.364 --> 00:44:20.658
Do you have asthma?
- It isn't.

914
00:44:20.741 --> 00:44:22.576
Let me continue.
-Sorry.

915
00:44:22.660 --> 00:44:25.245
I was working at Gazi's night club,

916
00:44:25.329 --> 00:44:29.583
when Wife Hwang hired me at the casino.

917
00:44:29.667 --> 00:44:31.919
"Maybe sugar mama."
-So.

918
00:44:32.002 --> 00:44:33.045
Let's continue.
-Then?

919
00:44:33.128 --> 00:44:34.713
"If you get caught, I'll shoot you."

920
00:44:35.422 --> 00:44:37.508
What?
- He is threatened with a gun.

921
00:44:38.008 --> 00:44:39.385
What did you do?
- Please explain.

922
00:44:39.468 --> 00:44:41.303
Did you get caught with the Wife?

923
00:44:41.387 --> 00:44:43.430
He acted like you, Detective.

924
00:44:43.514 --> 00:44:47.935
Manager Kim thought,
that there was something between us.

925
00:44:48.977 --> 00:44:51.355
I was a singer who loved music,

926
00:44:51.438 --> 00:44:53.732
and the Wife just admired my voice.

927
00:44:53.816 --> 00:44:55.359
Here is an important piece of evidence.

928
00:44:55.943 --> 00:44:58.153
I glanced at Singer Kim's phone.

929
00:44:58.821 --> 00:45:02.157
You wanted to go to Las Vegas.

930
00:45:02.241 --> 00:45:04.535
Director Kim didn't let you -

931
00:45:04.618 --> 00:45:06.703
and ordered to work until the 8th.

932
00:45:06.787 --> 00:45:08.747
According to the appendix -

933
00:45:08.831 --> 00:45:12.042
you had an audition in las vegas,

934
00:45:12.126 --> 00:45:15.421
but the manager refused it
without telling you.

935
00:45:15.504 --> 00:45:16.839
Really?

936
00:45:16.922 --> 00:45:21.176
A person named La Vega heard my song.

937
00:45:21.260 --> 00:45:25.222
Audition was supposed to be just a formality,

938
00:45:25.305 --> 00:45:27.683
but the manager interfered.

939
00:45:27.766 --> 00:45:29.768
He grabbed a business card -

940
00:45:29.852 --> 00:45:32.146
and demanded to see the offers
because of my contract.

941
00:45:32.229 --> 00:45:35.065
I didn't know about the audition song,

942
00:45:35.149 --> 00:45:37.693
and my chance to get to the USA disappeared.

943
00:45:37.776 --> 00:45:41.947
Didn't it feel like the end of the world?
It was your dream.

944
00:45:42.030 --> 00:45:44.283
One more thing.
- More?

945
00:45:44.366 --> 00:45:45.576
Enough.
- Jukra.

946
00:45:45.659 --> 00:45:48.745
I saw your seafood restaurant's account book,
which you kept.

947
00:45:48.829 --> 00:45:52.583
The restaurant bought small quantities of fish,
4,000 to 11,000 won per fish.

948
00:45:52.666 --> 00:45:55.169
You bought in large quantities
From the Merikrot fishery.

949
00:45:55.252 --> 00:45:58.380
Does it sound familiar?
-Sea grouse Jang's fish farm?

950
00:45:58.464 --> 00:46:01.258
According to the information, hundreds of fish were bought -

951
00:46:01.341 --> 00:46:04.720
at unusually low prices.

952
00:46:04.803 --> 00:46:06.263
Really?
-Yes.

953
00:46:06.346 --> 00:46:08.265
I didn't keep a record.

954
00:46:08.348 --> 00:46:12.311
I remember the fish coming
unusually cheap.

955
00:46:12.394 --> 00:46:16.398
My parents were excited,
and the restaurant flourished for a while.

956
00:46:16.482 --> 00:46:19.276
Were they from the Merikrot company?
-What?

957
00:46:19.359 --> 00:46:22.988
Are your parents fishermen?
- Answer me.

958
00:46:23.071 --> 00:46:24.781
Are your parents in the fishing business?

959
00:46:24.865 --> 00:46:26.200
They aren't.
- Don't they?

960
00:46:26.283 --> 00:46:27.493
Let it be.
-Clear.

961
00:46:27.576 --> 00:46:29.745
I examined two people today.

962
00:46:29.828 --> 00:46:30.662
More?

963
00:46:30.746 --> 00:46:31.955
More?
-Mayor.

964
00:46:32.039 --> 00:46:32.998
Me?

965
00:46:33.081 --> 00:46:35.209
You got the glee olympics here.

966
00:46:35.918 --> 00:46:37.211
That's a great achievement.

967
00:46:37.294 --> 00:46:39.129
Did you beat it?
-Yes.

968
00:46:39.213 --> 00:46:41.882
A hilarious sporting event?
-So.

969
00:46:41.965 --> 00:46:43.717
Hence the "Glee Olympics".
- Great.

970
00:46:43.800 --> 00:46:46.094
That's a great achievement.

971
00:46:46.762 --> 00:46:50.807
Do you hope it will help you become president?
-Of course.

972
00:46:50.891 --> 00:46:55.103
I found the casino development agreement.

973
00:46:55.187 --> 00:47:00.734
Manager Kim had to pay
monthly payment for the plot.

974
00:47:00.817 --> 00:47:02.736
Do we take it on the 8th of every month?

975
00:47:02.819 --> 00:47:03.946
Yes.
-8. day?

976
00:47:04.029 --> 00:47:05.697
The days read "Bong".

977
00:47:05.781 --> 00:47:07.449
So.
-How many days is it now?

978
00:47:07.533 --> 00:47:09.535
It's the 8th day now.
-So.

979
00:47:09.618 --> 00:47:12.162
I will receive a cash payment today.

980
00:47:12.246 --> 00:47:13.664
Really?
-Yes.

981
00:47:13.747 --> 00:47:15.707
Can you get it in cash?

982
00:47:15.791 --> 00:47:18.293
A political career requires a lot of money.

983
00:47:18.377 --> 00:47:19.878
Was it a donation?

984
00:47:19.962 --> 00:47:21.713
Forced donation?
-Yes.

985
00:47:21.797 --> 00:47:25.259
On Bong-cheon's phone
is their messages.

986
00:47:26.552 --> 00:47:27.844
"Rude little shit."

987
00:47:27.928 --> 00:47:31.431
Did you know about this?
- Did he save my number like that?

988
00:47:31.515 --> 00:47:33.225
Yes.
-"Rude little shit."

989
00:47:33.892 --> 00:47:35.352
That hurts deeply.

990
00:47:35.435 --> 00:47:37.312
This is important.

991
00:47:37.396 --> 00:47:38.564
Madam Mayor -

992
00:47:38.647 --> 00:47:43.026
ordered the manager to develop the casino
to the site of the landfill.

993
00:47:43.110 --> 00:47:46.238
You agreed to cash payments
always on the 8th.

994
00:47:46.321 --> 00:47:47.322
Exactly.

995
00:47:47.406 --> 00:47:49.491
He asked you to the vault,

996
00:47:49.575 --> 00:47:52.035
which was guarded and bulletproof.

997
00:47:52.119 --> 00:47:53.912
Soundproof and bulletproof.
-So.

998
00:47:53.996 --> 00:47:56.081
Really?
- It's completely sealed.

999
00:47:56.164 --> 00:47:58.041
This is his last message.

1000
00:47:58.125 --> 00:48:00.502
The secret of the jeons.
-What?

1001
00:48:00.586 --> 00:48:02.629
He believes in prophecies.
-What?

1002
00:48:02.713 --> 00:48:05.924
Your political choices
were based on predictions.

1003
00:48:06.008 --> 00:48:07.551
And to shamanism.

1004
00:48:07.634 --> 00:48:09.636
What is it about?
-Really?

1005
00:48:09.720 --> 00:48:13.515
Did you see the scrolls in the jewelry box?

1006
00:48:13.599 --> 00:48:17.728
One told to grow a flower on the grave,
another spoke of destruction.

1007
00:48:17.811 --> 00:48:19.855
On March 27, 2025 -

1008
00:48:19.938 --> 00:48:22.232
he had to raise
bigger flower on the grave -

1009
00:48:22.316 --> 00:48:23.984
to become king.

1010
00:48:24.067 --> 00:48:24.901
To be king?

1011
00:48:24.985 --> 00:48:27.696
It refers to the presidency.

1012
00:48:27.779 --> 00:48:31.199
Predictions are only indicative.

1013
00:48:31.283 --> 00:48:34.119
Would I trust them blindly?

1014
00:48:34.202 --> 00:48:35.996
Could you prove it?

1015
00:48:36.079 --> 00:48:38.248
I can prove it.

1016
00:48:38.332 --> 00:48:41.501
Here they were told to grow a flower.

1017
00:48:41.585 --> 00:48:44.421
The casino is shaped like a flower.

1018
00:48:44.504 --> 00:48:47.507
Yeah, but it turned out beautiful.

1019
00:48:47.591 --> 00:48:48.592
Or what?

1020
00:48:48.675 --> 00:48:52.679
What bothered me the most was
that the grave had to be filled with sacrifice.

1021
00:48:52.763 --> 00:48:54.556
You know what the grave refers to.

1022
00:48:54.640 --> 00:48:55.766
To the landfill.

1023
00:48:56.266 --> 00:48:59.478
Does that mean
that someone has to be killed first?

1024
00:48:59.561 --> 00:49:01.647
It was a prophecy

1025
00:49:01.730 --> 00:49:05.609
which my father got.

1026
00:49:05.692 --> 00:49:07.486
Did your father kill someone?

1027
00:49:08.570 --> 00:49:12.074
My family has known
shaman Myeong Long blade.

1028
00:49:12.157 --> 00:49:15.952
We ask the shaman
predictions every now and then.

1029
00:49:16.036 --> 00:49:19.748
When my father built a landfill site,

1030
00:49:19.831 --> 00:49:22.084
the employee had an accident.

1031
00:49:23.210 --> 00:49:25.504
After hearing the prophecy -

1032
00:49:25.587 --> 00:49:27.798
my father buried the man's body -

1033
00:49:27.881 --> 00:49:30.884
to the plot as a kind of sacrifice.

1034
00:49:30.967 --> 00:49:32.135
I don't know more.

1035
00:49:32.219 --> 00:49:33.929
To the landfill?
-A working man?

1036
00:49:34.012 --> 00:49:35.764
Did he bury the man?
-Yes.

1037
00:49:35.847 --> 00:49:39.142
You admitted to the illegal burial of a body.

1038
00:49:39.226 --> 00:49:41.520
My father did that, not me.

1039
00:49:41.603 --> 00:49:44.690
It's a disgrace to the family.
- Do you blame the deceased?

1040
00:49:44.773 --> 00:49:47.359
I was too young to know about it then.

1041
00:49:47.442 --> 00:49:49.236
So your father did it.
-So.

1042
00:49:49.319 --> 00:49:52.781
I apologize as his daughter.

1043
00:49:52.864 --> 00:49:56.076
But the sacrifice made my father's career flourish.

1044
00:49:56.159 --> 00:49:57.994
He served four terms.

1045
00:49:58.078 --> 00:50:01.039
Then I had to plant a flower on the grave.

1046
00:50:01.123 --> 00:50:03.834
My father had given a human sacrifice,

1047
00:50:03.917 --> 00:50:06.920
so I thought the place would be suitable for a casino.

1048
00:50:07.003 --> 00:50:08.255
I'm asking this.
-So...

1049
00:50:08.338 --> 00:50:09.423
So what?

1050
00:50:09.506 --> 00:50:13.176
I want to point out
something else from the notebook.

1051
00:50:13.260 --> 00:50:17.097
Other people have also received predictions.

1052
00:50:17.180 --> 00:50:20.392
We assume he wrote this
that shaman,

1053
00:50:20.475 --> 00:50:23.979
and Bong-cheon blackmailed Mayor Jeon
with a picture of a notebook.

1054
00:50:24.062 --> 00:50:26.606
How a notebook
ended up with Mayor Jeon?

1055
00:50:26.690 --> 00:50:31.862
He could have killed Bong-cheon
and usurps the notebook.

1056
00:50:31.945 --> 00:50:33.488
And not.

1057
00:50:33.572 --> 00:50:34.781
I didn't kill him.

1058
00:50:34.865 --> 00:50:37.534
I secretly stole the notebook.

1059
00:50:37.617 --> 00:50:39.995
When you had shot him twice?
-No.

1060
00:50:40.078 --> 00:50:42.539
I can't even use a gun.

1061
00:50:42.622 --> 00:50:45.208
It's not difficult.
-How does it happen?

1062
00:50:45.292 --> 00:50:46.501
How to…

1063
00:50:46.585 --> 00:50:48.587
I am completely ignorant.
-Well...

1064
00:50:48.670 --> 00:50:49.755
More and more suspicious.

1065
00:50:50.630 --> 00:50:53.967
Our mayor admitted the theft.

1066
00:50:54.050 --> 00:50:55.177
I couldn't help it.

1067
00:50:55.260 --> 00:50:57.679
My dreams were falling apart.

1068
00:50:57.763 --> 00:50:59.598
The crimes you admitted to -

1069
00:50:59.681 --> 00:51:02.058
would bring you
triple punishment.

1070
00:51:02.142 --> 00:51:05.103
But acknowledge my accomplishments.

1071
00:51:05.187 --> 00:51:09.107
One more thing.
-Still? What have I done?

1072
00:51:09.191 --> 00:51:13.570
The landfill site can be purchased commercially
into use after 30 years.

1073
00:51:13.653 --> 00:51:16.406
This landfill was built in 2000.

1074
00:51:16.490 --> 00:51:17.824
What year is it now?

1075
00:51:17.908 --> 00:51:19.034
It is now 2025.

1076
00:51:19.117 --> 00:51:22.829
It hasn't been that long.
- You built a casino before that.

1077
00:51:22.913 --> 00:51:24.080
A little too soon.

1078
00:51:24.164 --> 00:51:27.667
True, but think now.
-He admits everything.

1079
00:51:27.751 --> 00:51:28.627
Think about it.

1080
00:51:28.710 --> 00:51:31.797
The plot was ugly,
and residents complained about it.

1081
00:51:31.880 --> 00:51:33.507
It smelled.
- I don't know.

1082
00:51:33.590 --> 00:51:36.968
I made the decision for the benefit of the city.

1083
00:51:37.052 --> 00:51:39.095
Nevertheless -

1084
00:51:39.179 --> 00:51:43.475
Destroyed City didn't fit
for the location of the landfill.

1085
00:51:43.558 --> 00:51:47.729
Here it says:
"Getting it off the report will help."

1086
00:51:47.813 --> 00:51:51.441
So the landfill was built,
when the environmental report was encrypted.

1087
00:51:51.525 --> 00:51:54.319
Your father offered a human sacrifice,

1088
00:51:54.402 --> 00:51:58.240
and you built a casino on the land
to advance your career.

1089
00:51:58.323 --> 00:52:00.408
Exactly.
-But my family...

1090
00:52:00.492 --> 00:52:02.285
Despite this murder story -

1091
00:52:02.369 --> 00:52:04.120
he deserves the death sentence.

1092
00:52:04.204 --> 00:52:06.873
Heoyoung's special status
helped all of you.

1093
00:52:06.957 --> 00:52:08.875
People decide that.
-Listen.

1094
00:52:08.959 --> 00:52:12.629
Without the casino
Heoyoung would not have been successful.

1095
00:52:12.712 --> 00:52:14.714
Are you finished already, Jeweler?

1096
00:52:14.798 --> 00:52:16.091
The final blow.

1097
00:52:16.174 --> 00:52:18.468
This is going to hurt.
- Madam Mayor.

1098
00:52:18.552 --> 00:52:23.181
You commissioned a private investigator
investigate people associated with the landfill.

1099
00:52:23.265 --> 00:52:24.307
Who's the private detective?

1100
00:52:24.391 --> 00:52:25.767
Jang?
-Yes.

1101
00:52:26.393 --> 00:52:29.145
What did you want to find out?

1102
00:52:29.229 --> 00:52:33.817
If the notebook predictions
would have come out…

1103
00:52:33.900 --> 00:52:35.443
Let's kill everyone?
-Is that why?

1104
00:52:35.527 --> 00:52:36.361
Of course not.

1105
00:52:36.444 --> 00:52:39.197
I was trying to sort out the mess my father left behind -

1106
00:52:39.281 --> 00:52:41.116
with a public apology.

1107
00:52:41.199 --> 00:52:43.910
But first I had to know the facts.

1108
00:52:43.994 --> 00:52:45.829
Or so.
-Detective.

1109
00:52:45.912 --> 00:52:50.959
We need to investigate further
events of the year 2000 -

1110
00:52:51.042 --> 00:52:53.962
before the construction of the landfill.

1111
00:52:54.045 --> 00:52:57.507
You believe it all started with that.
-So.

1112
00:52:59.217 --> 00:53:01.928
Applause for the lady,
who has the wisdom of age.

1113
00:53:02.012 --> 00:53:04.472
Please clap.
-Good work.

1114
00:53:04.556 --> 00:53:07.475
Wisdom from 50 years.
-The wisdom of a rich woman.

1115
00:53:08.059 --> 00:53:10.103
I believe that Mayor Jeon -

1116
00:53:10.186 --> 00:53:14.900
is after these attacks
something to say.

1117
00:53:14.983 --> 00:53:17.694
That was enough.
- Are we listening to the politician?

1118
00:53:17.777 --> 00:53:19.946
First I want to mention the lips.

1119
00:53:20.030 --> 00:53:22.991
Did you have to take a picture that close?

1120
00:53:23.074 --> 00:53:25.118
His lips.
- They were weird.

1121
00:53:25.201 --> 00:53:29.080
The color makes the lips pop
from a penguin's beak.

1122
00:53:29.164 --> 00:53:32.459
At first I thought she had been kissed.

1123
00:53:32.542 --> 00:53:35.211
Could someone do that?
-But...

1124
00:53:35.295 --> 00:53:37.547
What would leave such a mark?

1125
00:53:37.631 --> 00:53:39.424
Like a kiss.
- Those lips.

1126
00:53:39.507 --> 00:53:44.012
Look at Mrs. Korukauppias.
- He did it.

1127
00:53:44.095 --> 00:53:48.183
Did Bong-cheon and the Jeweler kiss?

1128
00:53:48.892 --> 00:53:50.602
It didn't happen that way.

1129
00:53:50.685 --> 00:53:52.103
You are not serious.

1130
00:53:52.187 --> 00:53:55.106
Now I'll move on to Jang the Seagull.

1131
00:53:55.190 --> 00:53:57.150
I explored his room.

1132
00:53:57.233 --> 00:53:58.443
Me?
-So.

1133
00:54:00.153 --> 00:54:02.989
You enjoy cross-dressing.

1134
00:54:03.073 --> 00:54:04.282
What?

1135
00:54:04.366 --> 00:54:05.825
I found something strange.
-What?

1136
00:54:05.909 --> 00:54:10.038
I found in the wardrobe
a woman's dress and uniform.

1137
00:54:10.121 --> 00:54:12.123
I also found some camouflage gear.

1138
00:54:12.207 --> 00:54:15.835
Wig, sunglasses and marking paste.

1139
00:54:15.919 --> 00:54:19.297
It was used to mark playing cards
for cheating.

1140
00:54:19.381 --> 00:54:21.633
Did you play in disguise?

1141
00:54:21.716 --> 00:54:25.345
You surely know
that card shark success -

1142
00:54:25.428 --> 00:54:27.180
depends on invisibility.

1143
00:54:27.263 --> 00:54:31.351
The card shark cannot enter the games,
if he is identified.

1144
00:54:32.102 --> 00:54:37.774
That's why Jeweler An
didn't see me at the table.

1145
00:54:37.857 --> 00:54:39.275
we played together

1146
00:54:39.359 --> 00:54:41.444
but you didn't know me for a reason.

1147
00:54:42.112 --> 00:54:43.905
Is that why…
- Do you?

1148
00:54:43.989 --> 00:54:47.617
He didn't recognize you.
- Crazy.

1149
00:54:47.701 --> 00:54:49.119
He was in disguise.

1150
00:54:49.202 --> 00:54:51.287
He won all my money.

1151
00:54:51.371 --> 00:54:53.039
I played against a woman.

1152
00:54:53.123 --> 00:54:56.710
Baby Jang might be one of those,
who looks good as a woman.

1153
00:54:56.793 --> 00:54:58.294
How do you change your voice?

1154
00:54:58.378 --> 00:55:01.172
There is a device for that.

1155
00:55:01.256 --> 00:55:02.882
Is it?
-Wait a minute.

1156
00:55:04.342 --> 00:55:07.053
"Full on."
- He didn't lie.

1157
00:55:07.137 --> 00:55:09.180
Really genuine.
-And not.

1158
00:55:09.264 --> 00:55:10.557
I want to know this.

1159
00:55:10.640 --> 00:55:12.183
Why did Director Kim -

1160
00:55:12.267 --> 00:55:17.439
promised a reward of 50 million won for you?

1161
00:55:17.522 --> 00:55:18.565
Is it a reward?
-So.

1162
00:55:18.648 --> 00:55:21.609
Before his employment contract at the casino -

1163
00:55:21.693 --> 00:55:24.988
The cormorant was already known to them.

1164
00:55:25.071 --> 00:55:27.699
Were you blacklisted?
-I guess so.

1165
00:55:27.782 --> 00:55:31.369
He was hired at the casino
thanks to his skill.

1166
00:55:31.453 --> 00:55:33.580
I'll tell you about my findings.

1167
00:55:33.663 --> 00:55:37.292
Your mentor taught you
the art of disguise.

1168
00:55:37.375 --> 00:55:39.544
Don't students always have a mentor?

1169
00:55:39.627 --> 00:55:43.006
I found "The Card Shark's Secret Manual".
- Is there one?

1170
00:55:43.089 --> 00:55:46.926
It deals with camouflage,
mixing techniques and more.

1171
00:55:47.010 --> 00:55:51.806
The manual was written by
a person named Constable Hyeon.

1172
00:55:51.890 --> 00:55:52.766
What?

1173
00:55:52.849 --> 00:55:57.228
Yes, and I found him
photo and memento.

1174
00:55:57.312 --> 00:55:58.396
Ring a bell.

1175
00:55:58.480 --> 00:55:59.564
He is dead.

1176
00:55:59.647 --> 00:56:02.067
There was a photo of the urn.
-Wait a minute.

1177
00:56:02.150 --> 00:56:04.486
Will he take revenge for his mentor?
- Got under the train.

1178
00:56:04.569 --> 00:56:06.738
As mentioned earlier,

1179
00:56:06.821 --> 00:56:10.158
Jang the cormorant was a fisherman.

1180
00:56:10.241 --> 00:56:13.620
Weren't his parents?
-So.

1181
00:56:13.703 --> 00:56:17.290
Formerly Constable Hyeon
and learning cards -

1182
00:56:17.373 --> 00:56:19.959
he was an ordinary fisherman.
-So.

1183
00:56:20.043 --> 00:56:21.252
He was a fisherman.

1184
00:56:21.336 --> 00:56:24.089
Which then became a card shark.

1185
00:56:24.172 --> 00:56:27.926
He was skilled and caught more and more fish.

1186
00:56:28.009 --> 00:56:30.261
He was like that.

1187
00:56:30.345 --> 00:56:35.767
The last person,
whom Constable Hyeon met,

1188
00:56:35.850 --> 00:56:37.435
was director Bong-cheon Kim.

1189
00:56:38.061 --> 00:56:39.312
The boss killed him.

1190
00:56:39.395 --> 00:56:42.732
What if he doubted
Hyeon killed by Bong-cheon,

1191
00:56:42.816 --> 00:56:44.609
joined the casino under a fake name -

1192
00:56:44.692 --> 00:56:47.695
and waited for the right moment to kill?

1193
00:56:47.779 --> 00:56:48.822
That's my theory.

1194
00:56:49.864 --> 00:56:50.740
All right.

1195
00:56:51.574 --> 00:56:54.577
My mentor, Constable Hyeon,

1196
00:56:54.661 --> 00:56:57.163
belonged to the police force.

1197
00:56:57.247 --> 00:56:59.666
So was he a constable?
-Yes.

1198
00:57:00.792 --> 00:57:02.794
In his police work -

1199
00:57:02.877 --> 00:57:06.714
he explored
Four Seasons carefully by Jeon.

1200
00:57:06.798 --> 00:57:09.092
He dug things carefully.

1201
00:57:09.175 --> 00:57:12.220
I found out he was a policeman,

1202
00:57:12.303 --> 00:57:14.305
when I saw his notebook.

1203
00:57:14.389 --> 00:57:17.851
I thought he was investigating something big
on the day of his disappearance.

1204
00:57:17.934 --> 00:57:19.602
I thought so at first.

1205
00:57:19.686 --> 00:57:22.689
But when I couldn't
hold him for many days,

1206
00:57:22.772 --> 00:57:25.108
I went looking for him.

1207
00:57:25.191 --> 00:57:26.025
Clear.

1208
00:57:26.109 --> 00:57:29.404
The search led me
To Heoyoung's special city.

1209
00:57:30.488 --> 00:57:33.366
I had no proof
leader of Kim's plots,

1210
00:57:33.450 --> 00:57:36.578
but my instinct
convinced me I was right.

1211
00:57:36.661 --> 00:57:40.331
The police were going to drop the investigation,

1212
00:57:40.415 --> 00:57:44.210
so I knew I had to
reveal the truth yourself.

1213
00:57:44.294 --> 00:57:48.339
I played Bong-cheon Kim
owned illegal casinos -

1214
00:57:48.423 --> 00:57:52.260
and I scrubbed him clean.

1215
00:57:52.343 --> 00:57:55.013
Then he wanted me.

1216
00:57:56.055 --> 00:57:58.558
I didn't freak out, I just talked to him.

1217
00:57:58.641 --> 00:58:00.685
Good look.
-We only live once.

1218
00:58:00.768 --> 00:58:01.978
I said to him:

1219
00:58:02.061 --> 00:58:05.523
“I'm here
and ready to work for you."

1220
00:58:05.607 --> 00:58:09.569
He was happy and welcomed me
welcome with open arms.

1221
00:58:09.652 --> 00:58:12.280
Of course.
- That's how I infiltrated the casino.

1222
00:58:12.363 --> 00:58:13.323
Clear.

1223
00:58:13.406 --> 00:58:17.660
You mean Jang the Sea Grouse
saw Bong-cheon Kim as a man,

1224
00:58:17.744 --> 00:58:20.622
who basically killed his father.
-So.

1225
00:58:21.289 --> 00:58:24.042
I understand the revenge of the mentor,

1226
00:58:24.125 --> 00:58:25.793
but was that all?

1227
00:58:25.877 --> 00:58:29.130
He changed from a fisherman
into a vengeful card shark.

1228
00:58:29.214 --> 00:58:33.635
Is there still more to the story?

1229
00:58:34.302 --> 00:58:37.305
I want to study a person,
about which we know the least.

1230
00:58:37.388 --> 00:58:39.098
Doctor.
-So.

1231
00:58:39.182 --> 00:58:43.186
I'll tell you quickly,
how he became a chef.

1232
00:58:43.269 --> 00:58:45.313
Inspiration.
- I'm curious.

1233
00:58:45.396 --> 00:58:46.314
Fascinating.

1234
00:58:46.397 --> 00:58:50.026
I found in the box
medical reports.

1235
00:58:50.109 --> 00:58:52.570
In the inhabitants of Tuhokaupunki
had health concerns.

1236
00:58:52.654 --> 00:58:58.201
Heavy metal concentrations in the blood
were double.

1237
00:58:58.284 --> 00:59:01.704
All were diagnosed
just a flu though.

1238
00:59:02.330 --> 00:59:06.376
For patients who had ailments
due to heavy metal deposits,

1239
00:59:06.459 --> 00:59:09.629
only a diagnosis of flu was given.

1240
00:59:09.712 --> 00:59:15.677
And he got to his bank account
three billion won deposit.

1241
00:59:15.760 --> 00:59:16.761
From Bong-cheon Kim?

1242
00:59:16.844 --> 00:59:18.555
Four Seasons from Jeon?
-No.

1243
00:59:18.638 --> 00:59:20.348
Are you blaming your father again?

1244
00:59:20.431 --> 00:59:21.558
I swear…

1245
00:59:21.641 --> 00:59:24.727
You may not believe
that I didn't know anything about this.

1246
00:59:24.811 --> 00:59:26.604
I didn't know.
-Clear. Let's continue.

1247
00:59:26.688 --> 00:59:29.607
Politicians say so.
- I believe that at the moment.

1248
00:59:29.691 --> 00:59:32.402
I'm not the same as my father.
-The account book shows,

1249
00:59:32.485 --> 00:59:34.988
that the money was from Four Seasons Jeon.

1250
00:59:35.071 --> 00:59:39.033
The doctor immediately established a clinic with the money.

1251
00:59:39.117 --> 00:59:40.201
My own clinic.

1252
00:59:40.285 --> 00:59:42.745
Waist, shoulders,
knees and toes clinic.

1253
00:59:42.829 --> 00:59:45.915
Even newsreader Park Ji-yoon
was a regular patient.

1254
00:59:45.999 --> 00:59:47.166
I saw the photo.

1255
00:59:47.250 --> 00:59:49.836
Weird. He has strong bones.

1256
00:59:49.919 --> 00:59:52.046
He came to grind his strong bones.

1257
00:59:52.130 --> 00:59:54.424
Do I have to tell you?
-Nothing fit.

1258
00:59:54.507 --> 00:59:56.843
Shouldn't patient information be kept confidential?

1259
00:59:56.926 --> 00:59:59.012
HOPEFULLY THE RIGHT PARK JI-YOON
CAN'T HEAR

1260
00:59:59.095 --> 01:00:03.224
He did well
after opening a clinic in Gangdam,

1261
01:00:03.308 --> 01:00:04.559
but it changed.

1262
01:00:04.642 --> 01:00:05.810
How?
-What happened?

1263
01:00:05.893 --> 01:00:08.563
I saw the court's decision.
-What?

1264
01:00:08.646 --> 01:00:12.442
The plaintiff suffered a herniated disc
from gambling too much,

1265
01:00:12.525 --> 01:00:15.236
but after the Chef cut him
he became paralyzed.

1266
01:00:15.320 --> 01:00:16.904
Oh no.
-Goodness.

1267
01:00:16.988 --> 01:00:19.532
Due to a serious medical error -

1268
01:00:19.616 --> 01:00:22.869
The chef had to pay
five billion in compensation,

1269
01:00:22.952 --> 01:00:26.581
and he lost his license.

1270
01:00:26.664 --> 01:00:31.085
He took a loan of three billion
to pay for everything.

1271
01:00:31.169 --> 01:00:33.546
He came here.
-The money came from Bong-cheon.

1272
01:00:33.630 --> 01:00:36.174
Why work in the kitchen?
- I can explain.

1273
01:00:36.257 --> 01:00:37.967
I honestly don't know.

1274
01:00:38.051 --> 01:00:40.303
He asked to work in the kitchen of the casino,

1275
01:00:40.386 --> 01:00:41.888
and I came here.

1276
01:00:41.971 --> 01:00:44.140
And I was good at this job.

1277
01:00:45.016 --> 01:00:47.143
What are you talking about?

1278
01:00:47.226 --> 01:00:49.312
Did you find your calling?
- Crazy.

1279
01:00:49.395 --> 01:00:51.397
It wasn't easy for him.

1280
01:00:51.481 --> 01:00:53.316
I found signs in the room that

1281
01:00:53.399 --> 01:00:57.945
that he was looking for peace
It's from the Fleek Meditation Center.

1282
01:00:58.029 --> 01:01:00.907
I studied the brochure more closely.

1283
01:01:01.741 --> 01:01:03.493
He said his life was over,

1284
01:01:03.576 --> 01:01:05.453
and the source of all misery -

1285
01:01:05.536 --> 01:01:07.872
was Bong-cheon Kim.
- Bong-cheon.

1286
01:01:08.790 --> 01:01:12.502
He found peace of mind
Cult leader at Nan's place.

1287
01:01:12.585 --> 01:01:13.711
What was its name?

1288
01:01:13.795 --> 01:01:15.963
Messianic Church.
-So.

1289
01:01:16.047 --> 01:01:20.468
Messianic Church.
-I don't know if he turned,

1290
01:01:20.551 --> 01:01:23.429
but he sought guidance
about religion.

1291
01:01:23.513 --> 01:01:25.723
I thought it was a football club.
-Vibrate.

1292
01:01:25.807 --> 01:01:28.685
You thought it hinted at Messi.
-The body was left out.

1293
01:01:28.768 --> 01:01:32.772
What if it is also related
to a religious ritual?

1294
01:01:32.855 --> 01:01:35.858
Believe what you want.
-The Messianic Church.

1295
01:01:35.942 --> 01:01:39.779
I don't believe
for any of you to investigate further -

1296
01:01:40.405 --> 01:01:42.573
manager Kim's phone.

1297
01:01:42.657 --> 01:01:45.785
There was his
and messages from Tohelo Ani.

1298
01:01:45.868 --> 01:01:46.953
Duffer?
- I read them.

1299
01:01:47.036 --> 01:01:49.831
He procured fools for the boss,

1300
01:01:49.914 --> 01:01:53.793
such as the manager of a contracting company
and even authorized.

1301
01:01:54.377 --> 01:01:56.045
You brought everyone here.

1302
01:01:56.129 --> 01:01:57.505
To Bong-cheon.
-Artificial?

1303
01:01:57.588 --> 01:02:00.091
Are you barking?

1304
01:02:00.174 --> 01:02:03.636
You are the true tohelo of tohelos.
Pull yourself together.

1305
01:02:04.262 --> 01:02:06.139
No need to bark.
- I read the messages.

1306
01:02:06.222 --> 01:02:08.808
I thought that was it
from someone anonymous.

1307
01:02:08.891 --> 01:02:11.686
But they were talking about Jeweler Ani.

1308
01:02:11.769 --> 01:02:13.646
"Tohelo" was a nickname.
-I was wrong.

1309
01:02:13.730 --> 01:02:16.190
I thought about this too.
-I didn't know.

1310
01:02:16.274 --> 01:02:20.403
I found a safe in the manager's office -

1311
01:02:20.486 --> 01:02:22.572
Behind the Joker portrait.

1312
01:02:23.990 --> 01:02:29.537
When I opened the drawer, there was a box.

1313
01:02:29.620 --> 01:02:31.789
A box decorated with jewels.

1314
01:02:31.873 --> 01:02:34.834
I found this inside the box.

1315
01:02:40.381 --> 01:02:41.591
A gun.

1316
01:02:42.759 --> 01:02:43.801
There was a gun.

1317
01:02:44.552 --> 01:02:45.887
How did the leader die?

1318
01:02:45.970 --> 01:02:47.847
He was shot.
-So.

1319
01:02:47.930 --> 01:02:50.558
I found a revolver.
-Was there a gun?

1320
01:02:50.641 --> 01:02:54.979
And next to it were two bullets.

1321
01:02:55.062 --> 01:02:58.775
They had clearly been shot at something,

1322
01:02:58.858 --> 01:03:00.359
for they were twisted.

1323
01:03:00.443 --> 01:03:04.447
I unloaded the gun and noticed
that it had been shot twice.

1324
01:03:04.530 --> 01:03:06.741
There were four cartridges left.

1325
01:03:06.824 --> 01:03:08.785
That's why -

1326
01:03:08.868 --> 01:03:12.663
I'm sure with this gun
shot director Kim.

1327
01:03:12.747 --> 01:03:15.958
He was shot with his own gun.

1328
01:03:16.042 --> 01:03:17.460
So it seems.

1329
01:03:17.543 --> 01:03:20.880
We need to find out
who can claim a gun.

1330
01:03:20.963 --> 01:03:22.507
I have an answer.

1331
01:03:22.590 --> 01:03:26.761
The box had a logo and the letter "A".
-Really?

1332
01:03:27.386 --> 01:03:28.429
"A."

1333
01:03:28.513 --> 01:03:30.932
What about it?
-Doesn't it refer to the Jeweler?

1334
01:03:31.015 --> 01:03:33.267
Eli Korukauppa A.
-Jeweler An.

1335
01:03:33.351 --> 01:03:35.728
Do you sell them in your store?

1336
01:03:35.812 --> 01:03:39.774
This is an important piece of evidence,
so please explain.

1337
01:03:39.857 --> 01:03:41.526
I gave it to him.
-A gun?

1338
01:03:41.609 --> 01:03:42.443
So.

1339
01:03:43.820 --> 01:03:44.946
Scary woman.

1340
01:03:45.029 --> 01:03:46.739
What's so scary about a gun gift?

1341
01:03:46.823 --> 01:03:48.908
Do you sell guns in your store?

1342
01:03:48.991 --> 01:03:52.537
Did I give up the gun just because
that i sell them you jerk?

1343
01:03:52.620 --> 01:03:55.122
I bought the gun as a gift for him.

1344
01:03:55.206 --> 01:03:57.708
You are frustrating.
-Why a gun?

1345
01:03:57.792 --> 01:04:00.711
Why a gun?
-Well, what do you think?

1346
01:04:02.296 --> 01:04:03.589
Why is a gun needed?

1347
01:04:03.673 --> 01:04:06.509
So he can be killed later?
-Yes.

1348
01:04:07.927 --> 01:04:09.554
I gave the gun to kill him.

1349
01:04:09.637 --> 01:04:11.556
I thought if I let it,

1350
01:04:11.639 --> 01:04:13.474
i see where he keeps it.

1351
01:04:13.558 --> 01:04:14.600
And not.

1352
01:04:14.684 --> 01:04:16.143
Did you kill him?

1353
01:04:16.227 --> 01:04:17.645
I couldn't.

1354
01:04:17.728 --> 01:04:19.146
Some fool got there first.

1355
01:04:19.230 --> 01:04:22.483
Someone else knew the gun was there, too.

1356
01:04:22.567 --> 01:04:24.485
Clear.
- We will investigate this further.

1357
01:04:25.194 --> 01:04:26.153
And then this.

1358
01:04:26.237 --> 01:04:30.199
I didn't find out
what the Jeweler did before.

1359
01:04:30.283 --> 01:04:31.534
Don't you?

1360
01:04:31.617 --> 01:04:33.703
He was an official.

1361
01:04:33.786 --> 01:04:34.829
Really?
-Yes.

1362
01:04:34.912 --> 01:04:37.874
He was working at the Ministry of the Interior.

1363
01:04:38.666 --> 01:04:40.751
I found the contract between you and the manager.

1364
01:04:40.835 --> 01:04:43.629
You had to pay five million,

1365
01:04:43.713 --> 01:04:45.631
when residents move.
-Compensation.

1366
01:04:45.715 --> 01:04:49.719
You agreed to pay a million
and you shared the rest with the manager.

1367
01:04:49.802 --> 01:04:51.804
You are right.
-So.

1368
01:04:51.888 --> 01:04:53.139
You are evil.
- Did you take the money?

1369
01:04:53.222 --> 01:04:57.852
You signed your contract on May 6, 2002.

1370
01:04:57.935 --> 01:05:02.106
The date though
was changed to the 11th.

1371
01:05:02.189 --> 01:05:04.817
I must say

1372
01:05:04.901 --> 01:05:09.614
that he hated to do
agreements with the manager.

1373
01:05:09.697 --> 01:05:13.200
After all, they have a close relationship.
-Why do you say that?

1374
01:05:13.284 --> 01:05:18.581
I found it on his phone
messages from 2002.

1375
01:05:18.664 --> 01:05:23.586
Manager Kim pressed him
to consider the offer.

1376
01:05:23.669 --> 01:05:26.255
Jeweler An rejected her -

1377
01:05:26.339 --> 01:05:28.925
and threatened to inform the police.

1378
01:05:29.008 --> 01:05:31.218
Was he an uncompromising official?

1379
01:05:31.302 --> 01:05:36.265
Which made him change his mind
May 6-11?

1380
01:05:36.349 --> 01:05:38.643
When did his sister die?

1381
01:05:38.726 --> 01:05:40.353
Do you want my story?

1382
01:05:40.937 --> 01:05:43.689
Did you do something for the leader,

1383
01:05:43.773 --> 01:05:45.900
when you were in government bread?

1384
01:05:46.859 --> 01:05:50.112
My sister always told me to be -

1385
01:05:50.196 --> 01:05:51.697
upright and decent.

1386
01:05:51.781 --> 01:05:55.284
That's why I banned the manager
not to contact you again.

1387
01:05:56.077 --> 01:05:59.121
Then my sister got hit by a car.

1388
01:05:59.205 --> 01:06:01.332
I needed money for his surgery.

1389
01:06:01.415 --> 01:06:05.711
That's why I changed my mind
and I signed the contract on the 11th.

1390
01:06:05.795 --> 01:06:07.546
Or so.
- That's what happened.

1391
01:06:07.630 --> 01:06:12.468
Didn't you notice the note in the envelope?
- I don't.

1392
01:06:12.551 --> 01:06:14.095
He had to move the residents -

1393
01:06:14.178 --> 01:06:16.639
and bury opponents in the landfill.

1394
01:06:17.390 --> 01:06:19.684
On the back of the note was the author's name.

1395
01:06:20.643 --> 01:06:22.269
Four Seasons Jeon.
-What?

1396
01:06:22.353 --> 01:06:25.773
How many messes you made
still have to clean up, dad?

1397
01:06:26.440 --> 01:06:29.902
Based on your tone of voice
you could kill your father yourself.

1398
01:06:29.986 --> 01:06:32.655
Didn't you know about your father's activities?

1399
01:06:32.738 --> 01:06:37.618
Weren't you closely involved?
in building a casino on top of a landfill?

1400
01:06:37.702 --> 01:06:38.536
Yes I was.

1401
01:06:38.619 --> 01:06:43.499
You seemed to apply
land rezoning.

1402
01:06:43.582 --> 01:06:46.836
You planned a stadium instead of a casino.

1403
01:06:46.919 --> 01:06:48.504
Because of the Joy Olympics.

1404
01:06:48.587 --> 01:06:51.674
Absolutely.
The mayor signed the paper,

1405
01:06:51.757 --> 01:06:54.635
but Manager Kim threw it on the floor.

1406
01:06:55.720 --> 01:06:57.972
That's why I suggested moving the casino.

1407
01:06:58.055 --> 01:06:59.598
I promised to forget about the rent.

1408
01:06:59.682 --> 01:07:01.475
For the casino to move?
-So.

1409
01:07:01.559 --> 01:07:02.893
Would you give it up?

1410
01:07:02.977 --> 01:07:06.480
The stadium does not fit in other cities.

1411
01:07:06.564 --> 01:07:08.941
Where would he go?
- The stadium is coming here.

1412
01:07:09.025 --> 01:07:10.651
To the casino grounds.
-So.

1413
01:07:10.735 --> 01:07:13.946
Joy Olympics
are of course more important.

1414
01:07:15.031 --> 01:07:16.741
The mayor and predictions.

1415
01:07:16.824 --> 01:07:20.119
This cannot be taken lightly.

1416
01:07:20.703 --> 01:07:23.039
He firmly believed,

1417
01:07:23.122 --> 01:07:28.127
that his father won four elections
thanks to the predictions.

1418
01:07:28.210 --> 01:07:30.921
Predictions of his own
at the time of his candidacy -

1419
01:07:31.005 --> 01:07:34.675
were therefore even more important to him.

1420
01:07:34.759 --> 01:07:38.387
He concentrated
to a bigger goal, the stadium.

1421
01:07:38.471 --> 01:07:42.224
Bong-cheon Kim was in the way
and blackmailed him with a notebook,

1422
01:07:42.308 --> 01:07:46.020
so she definitely wanted to get rid of him.

1423
01:07:46.103 --> 01:07:48.105
His father buried a man,

1424
01:07:48.189 --> 01:07:50.816
so he believed he could kill.

1425
01:07:51.734 --> 01:07:55.488
I found the manager in the study
conclusive evidence.

1426
01:07:55.571 --> 01:07:59.408
Did anyone notice the button on the floor?

1427
01:07:59.492 --> 01:08:00.659
I didn't notice.

1428
01:08:00.743 --> 01:08:02.703
There was a button.

1429
01:08:02.787 --> 01:08:06.665
It was related to the board,
which covered the secret compartment.

1430
01:08:06.749 --> 01:08:08.417
Did it fall from the gun applicant?

1431
01:08:08.501 --> 01:08:11.295
It fell out of the gun
when applying or returning,

1432
01:08:11.378 --> 01:08:13.380
for it was by the safe.

1433
01:08:13.464 --> 01:08:14.757
Let's check the shirt.

1434
01:08:14.840 --> 01:08:16.300
Different color.

1435
01:08:16.383 --> 01:08:19.845
The button was black.
- It looked like a button on a man's suit.

1436
01:08:19.929 --> 01:08:20.846
Jang the cormorant.

1437
01:08:20.930 --> 01:08:22.765
So!
-Show me your coat.

1438
01:08:22.848 --> 01:08:24.642
Put your hands up.

1439
01:08:26.811 --> 01:08:28.604
Hands up or they'll be crushed!

1440
01:08:28.687 --> 01:08:31.273
Don't now. Must blood be shed?

1441
01:08:31.357 --> 01:08:33.234
How many buttons?
- One is missing.

1442
01:08:33.317 --> 01:08:34.568
There are only two here.

1443
01:08:34.652 --> 01:08:36.821
Is bloodshed necessary?

1444
01:08:36.904 --> 01:08:39.073
Bring the game.

1445
01:08:39.156 --> 01:08:41.867
So the button belongs to you.

1446
01:08:41.951 --> 01:08:45.287
What were you going to do with the gun?
- I'll tell.

1447
01:08:46.247 --> 01:08:48.707
I planned too -

1448
01:08:48.791 --> 01:08:50.042
killing me -

1449
01:08:50.835 --> 01:08:52.336
By Bong-cheon Kim.

1450
01:08:53.254 --> 01:08:54.922
I planned it.
- I guessed.

1451
01:08:55.005 --> 01:08:58.676
I knew where the gun was kept.

1452
01:08:59.343 --> 01:09:01.804
It went like this.

1453
01:09:01.887 --> 01:09:05.766
He went on a rampage and blamed the game
as a scam at 22:05.

1454
01:09:05.850 --> 01:09:07.476
A jeweler?
-So.

1455
01:09:07.560 --> 01:09:09.311
You finally figured out the scam.

1456
01:09:09.395 --> 01:09:13.399
The game was stopped at around 22:10.

1457
01:09:14.150 --> 01:09:16.485
I was dressed as a woman,

1458
01:09:16.569 --> 01:09:19.822
so I went to the wash
and changing clothes.

1459
01:09:20.531 --> 01:09:22.533
The casino's one-year anniversary was coming up,

1460
01:09:22.616 --> 01:09:24.076
and the boss would take care of the payments,

1461
01:09:25.202 --> 01:09:27.872
so I decided to carry out my plan.

1462
01:09:27.955 --> 01:09:31.417
I went to his office
around 10:55 p.m.

1463
01:09:31.500 --> 01:09:35.296
I took the gun to kill him there.

1464
01:09:35.379 --> 01:09:39.258
He handled the payments
every 7th of the month at 11pm.

1465
01:09:39.341 --> 01:09:40.843
The jeweler knew it.

1466
01:09:40.926 --> 01:09:42.595
So.
-Casino payment split?

1467
01:09:42.678 --> 01:09:44.388
He took care of them himself.

1468
01:09:44.471 --> 01:09:46.724
I waited but he didn't come.

1469
01:09:46.807 --> 01:09:50.144
He was not seen by 11:10 p.m.,

1470
01:09:50.227 --> 01:09:53.355
when I heard someone calling him.

1471
01:09:54.023 --> 01:09:56.775
There was someone at the door. I knew I was in trouble.

1472
01:09:56.859 --> 01:09:58.611
Who was that?
-Did you see?

1473
01:09:58.694 --> 01:10:01.906
I didn't see, but he asked the manager.

1474
01:10:01.989 --> 01:10:03.616
Man or woman?
-Did you hear a cough?

1475
01:10:03.699 --> 01:10:05.659
It was a man.
- A man?

1476
01:10:05.743 --> 01:10:06.702
Exactly.

1477
01:10:07.745 --> 01:10:08.913
Was that you?

1478
01:10:08.996 --> 01:10:10.331
That was me.

1479
01:10:10.414 --> 01:10:11.957
Why…
- Are you kidding me?

1480
01:10:12.041 --> 01:10:14.835
There was only one door in the room.
You would have bumped into each other.

1481
01:10:14.919 --> 01:10:18.505
Another door leads to the stage.

1482
01:10:19.423 --> 01:10:23.344
I thought it wasn't a good day
kill him

1483
01:10:23.427 --> 01:10:26.013
so i put the gun back.

1484
01:10:26.096 --> 01:10:29.141
I didn't see anything else then.

1485
01:10:29.225 --> 01:10:32.561
There were no spent cartridges.

1486
01:10:32.645 --> 01:10:34.396
Right?
-No.

1487
01:10:34.480 --> 01:10:36.857
The murder happened after that.
-Clear.

1488
01:10:36.941 --> 01:10:40.361
Singer, why did you go there at 23:10?

1489
01:10:40.444 --> 01:10:42.488
I wanted to meet the manager.
-Why?

1490
01:10:42.571 --> 01:10:45.491
I was feeling bad.
I took the medicine and fell asleep.

1491
01:10:45.574 --> 01:10:48.160
I woke up to a DM.

1492
01:10:48.244 --> 01:10:51.205
I went to ask the manager about the situation.

1493
01:10:51.288 --> 01:10:52.706
But in the study…

1494
01:10:52.790 --> 01:10:55.042
It was about a dream.
-Didn't you see him?

1495
01:10:55.125 --> 01:10:56.252
You don't.
- I don't.

1496
01:10:56.335 --> 01:10:57.711
Where was the manager?

1497
01:10:57.795 --> 01:10:59.797
Someone had to see him.

1498
01:10:59.880 --> 01:11:00.881
Jeweler An.

1499
01:11:00.965 --> 01:11:01.924
So.
-What?

1500
01:11:02.007 --> 01:11:03.384
Jeweler An.
-So?

1501
01:11:03.467 --> 01:11:07.888
Why did you rage?
The lost sums were worthless to you.

1502
01:11:09.431 --> 01:11:14.019
I knew he handled the payments then.
-Are you that close?

1503
01:11:14.103 --> 01:11:17.022
Only I didn't know.
- I am a VVIP guest.

1504
01:11:17.106 --> 01:11:20.067
Like he's not a tohelo.
- I was going to do that.

1505
01:11:20.150 --> 01:11:24.405
He knows everything.
- I let myself be taken advantage of.

1506
01:11:24.488 --> 01:11:26.699
I had decided to kill him on the 7th.

1507
01:11:26.782 --> 01:11:30.953
Mayor Jeon,
you arrived at around 9:40 p.m.

1508
01:11:31.036 --> 01:11:32.496
You were furious.
-So.

1509
01:11:32.579 --> 01:11:36.166
Yes. There were people on the third floor,

1510
01:11:36.750 --> 01:11:40.963
so i asked for the manager
to his study at 9:50 p.m.

1511
01:11:41.046 --> 01:11:44.133
How many did you leave?
- At 10 p.m.

1512
01:11:44.216 --> 01:11:45.676
You talked for 10 minutes.
-So.

1513
01:11:46.218 --> 01:11:51.724
It was a sign to rage at the gaming table.
I did so at 22:05.

1514
01:11:51.807 --> 01:11:54.727
The game was suspended at 22:10.
-So.

1515
01:11:54.810 --> 01:11:57.730
At 22:10 Bong-cheon offered -

1516
01:11:57.813 --> 01:12:00.190
to show me the vault.

1517
01:12:00.274 --> 01:12:01.442
Did you go there?

1518
01:12:01.525 --> 01:12:04.194
We went to see it.

1519
01:12:04.278 --> 01:12:05.404
Did you go inside?

1520
01:12:05.487 --> 01:12:08.073
The joker board is in the blind spot.

1521
01:12:08.157 --> 01:12:10.034
I was going to open the safe,

1522
01:12:10.117 --> 01:12:12.911
take a gun and shoot him.

1523
01:12:12.995 --> 01:12:16.081
But he suddenly asked me to the vault too.

1524
01:12:16.665 --> 01:12:19.877
I was going to surprise him,
but he told me to go first.

1525
01:12:19.960 --> 01:12:22.713
I thought the moment was not right for killing.

1526
01:12:22.796 --> 01:12:25.049
I gave up on the idea and left at 10:30 p.m.

1527
01:12:25.132 --> 01:12:26.550
The day didn't even fit.

1528
01:12:27.509 --> 01:12:32.389
We must keep this in mind
as the investigation continues.

1529
01:12:32.473 --> 01:12:36.518
I noticed the manager's room
and cleaning tools between the pallets.

1530
01:12:36.602 --> 01:12:38.645
Instructions were attached to the cart.

1531
01:12:38.729 --> 01:12:40.564
There was an inscription from the hill -

1532
01:12:40.647 --> 01:12:42.274
behind the casino.
-I noticed it.

1533
01:12:42.358 --> 01:12:45.152
As the carcasses rot,

1534
01:12:45.235 --> 01:12:48.447
accumulating methane gas
may catch fire.

1535
01:12:48.530 --> 01:12:52.034
It is likely
that the site of the former landfill -

1536
01:12:52.117 --> 01:12:55.913
made gas-related
accidents are possible.

1537
01:12:55.996 --> 01:12:58.916
The chef found information about it.

1538
01:12:58.999 --> 01:13:00.793
Let's hear him.
-Good.

1539
01:13:00.876 --> 01:13:02.920
Clear.
- Good job, Singer.

1540
01:13:03.003 --> 01:13:05.923
You spoke clearly even when you were unwell.

1541
01:13:06.006 --> 01:13:08.258
But you could put on a mask.

1542
01:13:09.218 --> 01:13:10.302
Goodness.

1543
01:13:11.845 --> 01:13:14.473
I'm Chef Jang.

1544
01:13:14.556 --> 01:13:18.727
The killer murdered the victim
and left the body on display.

1545
01:13:18.811 --> 01:13:23.440
Did the victim fall on stage,
or was he taken there?

1546
01:13:23.524 --> 01:13:28.487
I believe the victim was
crippled even before that.

1547
01:13:28.570 --> 01:13:30.948
He was shot twice on stage.

1548
01:13:31.031 --> 01:13:32.324
It was that easy.

1549
01:13:32.408 --> 01:13:33.992
But this is strange.

1550
01:13:34.076 --> 01:13:38.497
I concluded that he was shot on stage.

1551
01:13:38.580 --> 01:13:40.040
The gun does not have a silencer.

1552
01:13:40.124 --> 01:13:42.960
Didn't anyone hear the shots?

1553
01:13:43.043 --> 01:13:46.630
Everyone should have heard them.
-The vault is soundproof.

1554
01:13:46.713 --> 01:13:50.008
But the body was not found in the vault.

1555
01:13:50.092 --> 01:13:54.972
Don't forget that
that the body might be moved.

1556
01:13:55.055 --> 01:13:59.268
Who among us visited the vault?

1557
01:13:59.351 --> 01:14:00.978
Did you go?
-Jeweler.

1558
01:14:01.061 --> 01:14:01.895
So.

1559
01:14:01.979 --> 01:14:05.065
Mayor Jeon, you visited the vault
requesting your payment.

1560
01:14:05.649 --> 01:14:07.860
I will get it in cash the next day.

1561
01:14:07.943 --> 01:14:12.489
Only Bong-cheon Kim's voice opens the vault.
-So.

1562
01:14:12.573 --> 01:14:15.033
Can't find the answers there?

1563
01:14:15.117 --> 01:14:17.202
I would also like to remind

1564
01:14:17.286 --> 01:14:20.289
that there was a gas alarm next to the stage.

1565
01:14:21.373 --> 01:14:23.208
However, it doesn't work.

1566
01:14:24.251 --> 01:14:26.086
I couldn't turn it on,

1567
01:14:26.170 --> 01:14:27.796
so i opened it.

1568
01:14:27.880 --> 01:14:30.883
One of the three batteries was missing.

1569
01:14:31.508 --> 01:14:33.010
Someone deleted it.
-So.

1570
01:14:33.093 --> 01:14:35.262
Someone removed it beforehand -

1571
01:14:35.345 --> 01:14:37.598
to release gas.
-So.

1572
01:14:37.681 --> 01:14:40.225
There is a ventilation duct next to it.

1573
01:14:40.309 --> 01:14:42.394
Gas can pass through it.

1574
01:14:42.478 --> 01:14:44.646
If gas leaked through it,

1575
01:14:44.730 --> 01:14:46.398
and the warning did not work,

1576
01:14:46.482 --> 01:14:49.067
he would have lost consciousness suddenly.

1577
01:14:49.776 --> 01:14:53.447
That would be possible.

1578
01:14:54.031 --> 01:14:57.451
I found an envelope -

1579
01:14:57.534 --> 01:15:02.080
Inside jeweler Ani's desk.

1580
01:15:02.164 --> 01:15:05.626
It had an environmental report.

1581
01:15:05.709 --> 01:15:10.005
According to it, a dump
had caused trouble in the neighborhood -

1582
01:15:10.088 --> 01:15:11.465
with high levels of pollution.

1583
01:15:11.548 --> 01:15:15.469
That's why many locals
was heavy metal poisoning.

1584
01:15:15.552 --> 01:15:17.721
A lot of fish also died.
-So.

1585
01:15:17.804 --> 01:15:19.765
There were enough warning signs.

1586
01:15:19.848 --> 01:15:23.101
Because of the environmental report -

1587
01:15:23.185 --> 01:15:28.774
Rehti An led the demonstration
when representing a group of citizens.

1588
01:15:28.857 --> 01:15:32.027
The start-up was a custom job.
- He was assassinated.

1589
01:15:32.110 --> 01:15:36.698
In the photos of the demonstration
there is a man next to her.

1590
01:15:36.782 --> 01:15:37.950
Who?
- It was…

1591
01:15:39.076 --> 01:15:40.077
Who was that?

1592
01:15:40.160 --> 01:15:42.579
It was Bong-cheon Kim.
-Absolutely.

1593
01:15:42.663 --> 01:15:45.499
Jeweler Armas Bong-cheon
is also in the picture.

1594
01:15:45.582 --> 01:15:49.211
Listen up.
-Beyond belief.

1595
01:15:49.294 --> 01:15:51.505
Do not assume rashly,

1596
01:15:51.588 --> 01:15:55.676
that only Four Seasons
was involved in Rehti Ani's death.

1597
01:15:55.759 --> 01:16:00.222
Four Through Jeon's Commandments
realized by Bong-cheon Kim.

1598
01:16:00.305 --> 01:16:04.309
So.
-He is directly related to Rehdi's death.

1599
01:16:04.393 --> 01:16:08.105
Well said.
-Jeweler An knew it.

1600
01:16:08.188 --> 01:16:11.858
I will say this
due to the landfill blacklist.

1601
01:16:11.942 --> 01:16:13.652
Rehti An was at the top of the list.

1602
01:16:13.735 --> 01:16:18.824
And the list has a signature,
which belonged to Four Seasons Jeon.

1603
01:16:19.366 --> 01:16:21.994
So…
- That's right, dad.

1604
01:16:22.077 --> 01:16:23.662
All of you -

1605
01:16:23.745 --> 01:16:27.249
was a strong motive
leader to kill Kim.

1606
01:16:27.332 --> 01:16:29.251
And then the landfill.

1607
01:16:29.334 --> 01:16:33.672
You all join the dump
in some way.

1608
01:16:33.755 --> 01:16:37.843
So.
-But why the killer -

1609
01:16:37.926 --> 01:16:40.721
put the body on display?

1610
01:16:40.804 --> 01:16:43.765
Who knew about the gun? I didn't know.

1611
01:16:44.391 --> 01:16:47.185
How about you, Singer?
-I was threatened with a gun.

1612
01:16:47.269 --> 01:16:49.771
So.
- So I knew about the gun,

1613
01:16:49.855 --> 01:16:52.566
but I didn't know where it was stored.

1614
01:16:52.649 --> 01:16:54.401
I focused on the gun on my temple.

1615
01:16:54.484 --> 01:16:55.611
I didn't know.

1616
01:16:55.694 --> 01:16:56.653
I knew.

1617
01:16:56.737 --> 01:16:59.239
These two knew about the gun.
He gave it.

1618
01:16:59.323 --> 01:17:02.034
Three knew about the gun, two didn't.

1619
01:17:02.117 --> 01:17:03.368
Tough vote.

1620
01:17:03.452 --> 01:17:04.620
1. VOTING ROUND

1621
01:17:06.705 --> 01:17:10.167
THE DETECTIVE GIVES TWO VOICES,
AFTER THE FIRST DISCUSSION

1622
01:17:12.210 --> 01:17:13.378
First of all -

1623
01:17:13.462 --> 01:17:15.756
he destroyed the Singer's dream.

1624
01:17:15.839 --> 01:17:18.884
From Chef Jang
came under the casino.

1625
01:17:18.967 --> 01:17:21.511
It had been difficult for him too.

1626
01:17:21.595 --> 01:17:24.598
In Nirvana.
-The jeweler wanted to avenge his sister,

1627
01:17:24.681 --> 01:17:27.392
A seal because of his mentor.

1628
01:17:27.476 --> 01:17:30.604
Then there's the woman who soon finds out,

1629
01:17:30.687 --> 01:17:33.023
can he become president.

1630
01:17:33.106 --> 01:17:36.568
No one else is chasing something
just as desperately.

1631
01:17:36.652 --> 01:17:38.820
I can't be sure…

1632
01:17:38.904 --> 01:17:40.322
WHO WILL THE DETECTIVE VOTE FOR?

1633
01:17:46.078 --> 01:17:47.329
HE CHOOSE HIS JEWELERS

1634
01:17:47.412 --> 01:17:49.081
I couldn't do anything else.

1635
01:17:49.164 --> 01:17:50.582
I'm not surprised.
- Neither do I.

1636
01:17:50.666 --> 01:17:51.708
The evidence…

1637
01:17:51.792 --> 01:17:55.420
You suspect me because of my family member.
-Exactly.

1638
01:17:55.504 --> 01:17:57.547
It's poetic.
-What?

1639
01:17:57.631 --> 01:18:00.759
Gives a gun as a gift
and shoots the recipient with it.

1640
01:18:01.468 --> 01:18:05.055
The message was:
"I will shed as much of your blood—

1641
01:18:05.138 --> 01:18:06.890
like being dumped in a landfill."

1642
01:18:06.973 --> 01:18:07.974
Right-minded.

1643
01:18:08.058 --> 01:18:09.935
Be quiet now. Let's continue.

1644
01:18:10.644 --> 01:18:13.522
If my accusation makes you nervous,

1645
01:18:13.605 --> 01:18:16.233
use emotion to search for clues.

1646
01:18:16.316 --> 01:18:17.859
But let's think together.

1647
01:18:18.443 --> 01:18:20.987
Let's get back to the place.
-That sounds good.

1648
01:18:21.530 --> 01:18:22.489
Let's catch the killer.

1649
01:18:23.073 --> 01:18:25.200
CRIME SCENE REVEALS THE PERPETRATOR

1650
01:18:25.283 --> 01:18:27.536
I explored places I couldn't explore.

1651
01:18:28.412 --> 01:18:29.913
Let's see.

1652
01:18:31.248 --> 01:18:34.459
This place should be checked first.

1653
01:18:34.543 --> 01:18:36.294
How do we get to the vault?

1654
01:18:36.378 --> 01:18:38.422
BONG-CHEON KIM'S VAULT IS LOCKED

1655
01:18:38.505 --> 01:18:39.756
How do we get there?

1656
01:18:41.133 --> 01:18:44.886
"Activate voice recognition to confirm."

1657
01:18:45.512 --> 01:18:47.013
My name is Bong-cheon Kim.

1658
01:18:47.723 --> 01:18:48.765
Open the door.

1659
01:18:48.849 --> 01:18:50.350
Doesn't help.

1660
01:18:50.434 --> 01:18:52.811
Do you have the boss's voice saved?

1661
01:18:54.896 --> 01:18:57.190
INVESTIGATION OF CHEF JANG'S ROOM

1662
01:19:01.903 --> 01:19:03.029
What is this?

1663
01:19:04.072 --> 01:19:07.159
SOMETHING WAS FOUND UNDER THE MATTRESS

1664
01:19:11.037 --> 01:19:13.915
“Kitchen Master Jangin
witch soup recipe."

1665
01:19:15.167 --> 01:19:16.293
What the hell?

1666
01:19:17.878 --> 01:19:19.796
What is this thing?

1667
01:19:20.672 --> 01:19:22.048
Who is this man?

1668
01:19:24.092 --> 01:19:26.261
Watch out for him, Detective.

1669
01:19:26.344 --> 01:19:28.972
He is dangerous.
-Who?

1670
01:19:29.055 --> 01:19:31.057
A chef?
- He's dangerous.

1671
01:19:31.850 --> 01:19:33.977
Chef.
-Goodness.

1672
01:19:34.644 --> 01:19:35.854
What is this?

1673
01:19:36.688 --> 01:19:38.607
RECIPES FROM MASTER JANG

1674
01:19:38.690 --> 01:19:41.276
"Cut the fingers into suitable pieces.

1675
01:19:41.818 --> 01:19:44.780
Chop the thigh meat into bite-sized pieces.

1676
01:19:45.363 --> 01:19:49.701
Neat belly meats.
Punch holes in the flesh if it resists."

1677
01:19:50.368 --> 01:19:51.912
He adds fingers to the soup -

1678
01:19:51.995 --> 01:19:54.289
and thigh meat in salad.

1679
01:19:54.372 --> 01:19:57.959
Why do you add fingers to food?
-What?

1680
01:19:58.043 --> 01:20:00.837
It can't be true.
-Why thigh meat in soup?

1681
01:20:00.921 --> 01:20:02.172
Why such a salad?

1682
01:20:02.255 --> 01:20:04.883
NIGHT

1683
01:20:05.801 --> 01:20:08.094
Did you start cooking people?

1684
01:20:08.178 --> 01:20:09.763
A CULT FREAK WHO COOKS PEOPLE?

1685
01:20:09.846 --> 01:20:11.223
It can't be true.

1686
01:20:12.682 --> 01:20:14.309
Please explain this.

1687
01:20:14.392 --> 01:20:16.436
"Clean belly meat."

1688
01:20:16.520 --> 01:20:18.897
Bong-cheon Kim had a big stomach.

1689
01:20:18.980 --> 01:20:21.441
"Put holes in the flesh if it resists."

1690
01:20:21.525 --> 01:20:24.778
Is that why two holes?
- I'll take one.

1691
01:20:25.362 --> 01:20:27.697
It leaks from the same places as the body.

1692
01:20:27.781 --> 01:20:31.618
Looks like a dead person
especially around the stomach.

1693
01:20:31.701 --> 01:20:34.704
Head and shoulder.
- They are identical.

1694
01:20:34.788 --> 01:20:38.458
I wondered why the body was on display.
Now I know.

1695
01:20:38.542 --> 01:20:41.002
Look at the shoulder, the head and the blood.

1696
01:20:41.586 --> 01:20:43.129
He is the most suspicious.

1697
01:21:31.511 --> 01:21:36.516
Subtitles: Kati Karvonen

